1
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:22,137
Look! Another shooting star!

2
00:00:23,224 --> 00:00:25,224
Did you remember to make a
wish this time, buddy?

3
00:00:25,475 --> 00:00:27,475
Oh... I forgot...

4
00:00:32,938 --> 00:00:34,578
[cat meows]

5
00:00:35,994 --> 00:00:37,267
Are you serious?

6
00:00:37,254 --> 00:00:38,954
What do you mean you're going out?

7
00:00:38,979 --> 00:00:40,309
The guys are getting together.

8
00:00:40,430 --> 00:00:42,590
I'm allowed to go out sometimes,
you know.

9
00:00:42,950 --> 00:00:43,430
Sometimes?

10
00:00:43,630 --> 00:00:44,990
It's been every night lately.

11
00:00:45,330 --> 00:00:46,950
I'll come home early, alright?

12
00:00:48,230 --> 00:00:49,290
Thanks for coming!

13
00:00:49,770 --> 00:00:51,030
Sure, I'll be back.

14
00:00:59,800 --> 00:01:00,800
I know.

15
00:01:01,040 --> 00:01:02,735
Come on, let's go home.
[Kakashi sighs]

16
00:01:02,760 --> 00:01:05,379
Look, why don't we just do rock,
paper, scissors again?

17
00:01:05,536 --> 00:01:06,577
Oh, come on!

18
00:01:06,601 --> 00:01:08,980
There must be something more exciting we
can do!

19
00:01:09,280 --> 00:01:10,840
And you call yourself my rival?

20
00:01:11,260 --> 00:01:14,960
We have to get an early start tomorrow,
so let's just take a pass on tonight.

21
00:01:14,961 --> 00:01:17,080
A mission is no excuse!

22
00:01:17,780 --> 00:01:20,363
I have all this pent-up
energy inside me, so there's no

23
00:01:20,364 --> 00:01:23,620
better time than right now
for some really rigorous training!

24
00:01:24,140 --> 00:01:26,338
Honest to goodness,
discipline and hard work

25
00:01:26,339 --> 00:01:28,700
will lead us to success
in future missions!

26
00:01:28,980 --> 00:01:30,960
Are you even listening to me?!

27
00:01:30,961 --> 00:01:32,160
Forget that for now.

28
00:01:32,984 --> 00:01:34,600
Do you sense something strange?

29
00:01:35,259 --> 00:01:37,300
As if there was suddenly a dark chill in
the air?

30
00:01:37,301 --> 00:01:39,380
The only thing that's chilly is your
attitude!

31
00:01:39,700 --> 00:01:41,803
You must be much more hot-blooded!

32
00:01:46,349 --> 00:01:48,426
It's a full moon tonight, Sasuke.

33
00:01:49,504 --> 00:01:51,504
[infant starts]
[chuckles]

34
00:01:52,012 --> 00:01:54,432
[wind howling]

35
00:01:54,443 --> 00:01:56,443
[wind howling]
[gasps]

36
00:01:58,969 --> 00:02:00,360
What is this?

37
00:02:02,299 --> 00:02:05,676
I'm feeling... something ominous.

38
00:02:06,711 --> 00:02:08,711
[infant whines]

39
00:02:08,736 --> 00:02:10,970
[sighs]
There, there, it's okay.

40
00:02:12,710 --> 00:02:14,070
Don't cry, Sasuke.

41
00:02:14,810 --> 00:02:18,670
No matter what happens, your big brother
will protect you, I promise you that.

42
00:02:19,590 --> 00:02:20,590
Hm?

43
00:02:21,019 --> 00:02:22,303
Hmm

44
00:02:22,365 --> 00:02:24,365
[exhales smoke]

45
00:02:26,640 --> 00:02:27,860
It can't be.

46
00:02:31,701 --> 00:02:33,701
[explosion]

47
00:02:34,591 --> 00:02:37,374
[screaming]

48
00:02:42,939 --> 00:02:44,939
[coughing]

49
00:02:46,283 --> 00:02:47,029
Is that..?

50
00:02:47,032 --> 00:02:51,239
[growling]

51
00:02:51,264 --> 00:02:53,430
[gasp]
No, no way!

52
00:02:53,435 --> 00:02:56,171
[roars]

53
00:02:56,196 --> 00:02:57,456
The Ninetales!

54
00:02:58,618 --> 00:03:00,798
[screaming]

55
00:03:02,190 --> 00:03:04,190
[growling]

56
00:03:05,751 --> 00:03:07,751
[roars]

57
00:03:18,063 --> 00:03:20,336
[screaming]

58
00:03:20,763 --> 00:03:23,200
[infant crying]
Hey. It's okay.

59
00:03:23,355 --> 00:03:24,402
[grunts]

60
00:03:24,440 --> 00:03:25,940
It's the Ninetales!

61
00:03:26,363 --> 00:03:27,986
The demon fox is loose!

62
00:03:30,387 --> 00:03:32,417
What?
What's going on?!

63
00:03:32,441 --> 00:03:33,800
Just run, you idiot!

64
00:03:38,593 --> 00:03:40,593
[screaming]
Aah!

65
00:03:52,443 --> 00:03:55,201
[cries]

66
00:03:55,226 --> 00:03:58,401
Sasuke... It's okay now.

67
00:03:58,860 --> 00:04:00,606
I know that was a little scary.

68
00:04:00,755 --> 00:04:06,015
[crying continues]

69
00:04:06,170 --> 00:04:08,210
Lord Third, it's the Ninetales!

70
00:04:09,183 --> 00:04:11,483
The Ninetales is inside the village!

71
00:04:11,990 --> 00:04:13,130
Yes, I know that.

72
00:04:13,470 --> 00:04:14,710
I'll go restrain him.

73
00:04:15,230 --> 00:04:17,769
You and the others go protect all the
people of the village.

74
00:04:18,130 --> 00:04:19,130
Yes, sir!

75
00:04:20,209 --> 00:04:21,829
Was Kushina's seal broken?

76
00:04:22,550 --> 00:04:25,430
We failed even with all the safeguards we
put in place.

77
00:04:26,289 --> 00:04:27,370
Biwako.

78
00:04:29,730 --> 00:04:31,330
Damn you, Ninetales!

79
00:04:31,570 --> 00:04:33,750
It's time to release all my pent-up
energy!

80
00:04:33,850 --> 00:04:35,266
We don't know what we're up against.

81
00:04:35,290 --> 00:04:35,890
Come on!

82
00:04:35,930 --> 00:04:37,250
I'll be your opponent!

83
00:04:37,275 --> 00:04:38,245
Wait!

84
00:04:38,270 --> 00:04:39,866
Huh?

85
00:04:40,016 --> 00:04:41,965
Gather immediately in the guard room.

86
00:04:41,990 --> 00:04:42,990
Why?

87
00:04:43,490 --> 00:04:45,430
The third Hokage ordered it!

88
00:04:45,590 --> 00:04:46,005
What?

89
00:04:46,029 --> 00:04:47,029
Lord Hiruzen did?

90
00:04:47,330 --> 00:04:48,330
Well, you heard him.

91
00:04:48,610 --> 00:04:49,610
Let's go, Guy.

92
00:04:50,035 --> 00:04:52,898
[yells]
Huurrrrgh!

93
00:04:53,150 --> 00:04:54,883
Now is our chance!

94
00:04:54,950 --> 00:04:55,950
All of you, go!

95
00:04:56,050 --> 00:04:57,090
Evacuate the village!

96
00:04:59,526 --> 00:05:00,210
Are we ready?

97
00:05:00,690 --> 00:05:01,690
Yeah.

98
00:05:04,523 --> 00:05:06,840
Over here, Ninetales!
Hyah!

99
00:05:11,363 --> 00:05:12,170
Right here!

100
00:05:13,926 --> 00:05:15,210
Your battle's here!

101
00:05:16,500 --> 00:05:17,596
With me!

102
00:05:17,605 --> 00:05:21,291
[grunts]
[Ninetails roars]

103
00:05:21,346 --> 00:05:22,645
Do not falter!

104
00:05:22,670 --> 00:05:26,630
Even if we can't defeat the Ninetales,
we must allow the villagers to escape!

105
00:05:26,650 --> 00:05:27,747
[gasp]

106
00:05:30,136 --> 00:05:31,740
Don't take action on your own!

107
00:05:31,765 --> 00:05:33,496
Assemble around Lord Hiruzen!

108
00:05:34,810 --> 00:05:36,330
Carry out your orders!

109
00:05:37,630 --> 00:05:40,210
As Hokage, I must protect the village.

110
00:05:40,830 --> 00:05:41,830
My family.

111
00:05:42,230 --> 00:05:44,310
This is what I have to do right now.

112
00:05:46,109 --> 00:05:47,589
[growls]

113
00:05:49,922 --> 00:05:51,922
[growling]

114
00:05:51,916 --> 00:05:59,769
[roars]

115
00:06:03,180 --> 00:06:07,856
[screaming]

116
00:06:16,420 --> 00:06:18,600
Iruka, are you all right?

117
00:06:20,120 --> 00:06:21,580
Mom, what's the matter?

118
00:06:23,780 --> 00:06:25,140
Dad, look, it's Mom!

119
00:06:25,180 --> 00:06:26,180
She's been hit!

120
00:06:26,440 --> 00:06:28,460
Why didn't you stay at the shelter,
Iruka?

121
00:06:29,180 --> 00:06:30,340
Leave your mother to me.

122
00:06:30,920 --> 00:06:33,020
You hurry up and get out of here,
now!

123
00:06:33,740 --> 00:06:34,500
No, Dad!

124
00:06:34,680 --> 00:06:38,100
I'm not just gonna run away and leave you
and Mom behind here!

125
00:06:38,320 --> 00:06:40,260
I'm gonna stay and protect Mom!

126
00:06:40,500 --> 00:06:41,960
Don't you dare push me, son!

127
00:06:42,180 --> 00:06:44,420
It's a parent's duty to protect their
children!

128
00:06:49,520 --> 00:06:51,560
We have to protect the village!

129
00:06:52,180 --> 00:06:55,040
We need to drive the Ninetales outside the
village walls!

130
00:06:55,140 --> 00:06:56,140
Right!

131
00:06:56,280 --> 00:06:58,860
Buy me some time so I can ready my jutsu!

132
00:06:59,420 --> 00:07:00,620
Do not let up the attack!

133
00:07:01,120 --> 00:07:01,540
Yes, sir!

134
00:07:01,880 --> 00:07:02,880
Let's go!

135
00:07:03,508 --> 00:07:04,118
[woosh]

136
00:07:09,285 --> 00:07:12,565
[roaring]

137
00:07:12,592 --> 00:07:14,195
[screaming]

138
00:07:15,570 --> 00:07:17,710
Ninja Art Summoning!

139
00:07:18,930 --> 00:07:21,516
Monkey King Enma, appear!

140
00:07:25,736 --> 00:07:27,430
The Ninetales, huh?

141
00:07:28,150 --> 00:07:29,590
So the seal was broken.

142
00:07:30,730 --> 00:07:32,230
We'll drive it from the village.

143
00:07:32,930 --> 00:07:34,370
With the Adamantine Nyoi!

144
00:07:34,371 --> 00:07:36,423
Transformation, gotcha!

145
00:07:42,470 --> 00:07:44,730
Now, Enma! Let's go!
Right!

146
00:07:45,636 --> 00:07:46,730
Extend!

147
00:07:48,036 --> 00:07:52,553
[roars]

148
00:07:56,770 --> 00:07:59,110
Good, it's been driven out of the village!

149
00:08:00,070 --> 00:08:01,070
Now keep at him!

150
00:08:01,210 --> 00:08:02,210
One after another!

151
00:08:09,520 --> 00:08:11,149
Hold the attack, all of you!

152
00:08:11,174 --> 00:08:12,566
Wait for the fourth hokage!

153
00:08:15,001 --> 00:08:17,001
[groaning]
Iruka...

154
00:08:17,423 --> 00:08:18,650
No, let me go!

155
00:08:18,990 --> 00:08:21,650
My mom and dad are still fighting back
there!

156
00:08:34,140 --> 00:08:35,539
The barriers disappeared!

157
00:08:49,620 --> 00:08:50,620
Lord Fourth!

158
00:08:51,920 --> 00:08:52,920
Lady Kushina.

159
00:08:53,700 --> 00:08:55,988
Take her to the hospital right away.

160
00:08:56,013 --> 00:08:57,620
Summon the medical ninja.

161
00:08:58,769 --> 00:09:00,100
Please, Lord Third.

162
00:09:01,840 --> 00:09:02,840
Kushina...

163
00:09:03,020 --> 00:09:07,316
I beg you, please take care... of our
baby.

164
00:09:07,400 --> 00:09:08,260
Yes, of course.

165
00:09:08,360 --> 00:09:10,080
You don't need to worry about that.

166
00:09:10,520 --> 00:09:12,900
His name is...

167
00:09:12,927 --> 00:09:14,927
Naruto.

168
00:09:15,080 --> 00:09:16,220
Minato and I.

169
00:09:17,560 --> 00:09:21,120
Together, we both picked that name out of
the pages.

170
00:09:21,121 --> 00:09:24,200
Of Jiraiya Sensei's novel.

171
00:09:24,659 --> 00:09:26,073
Naruto, you say?

172
00:09:26,109 --> 00:09:27,015
Very well.

173
00:09:27,040 --> 00:09:28,980
I'll take responsibility.

174
00:09:29,020 --> 00:09:32,180
But now, for the sake of your child,
you must rest.

175
00:09:43,059 --> 00:09:44,480
Kushina.

176
00:09:44,481 --> 00:09:46,100
I'll keep my promise.

177
00:09:55,171 --> 00:09:58,405
[birds chirping]

178
00:10:06,267 --> 00:10:09,814
[yawns]

179
00:10:12,115 --> 00:10:13,388
Huh!?

180
00:10:13,421 --> 00:10:15,181
What... Huh!?

181
00:10:15,726 --> 00:10:17,440
What the hell is this?

182
00:10:28,700 --> 00:10:30,050
Naruto Uzumaki!

183
00:10:30,590 --> 00:10:31,590
That's me!

184
00:10:31,710 --> 00:10:33,510
One day, I'll be hokage!

185
00:10:39,150 --> 00:10:40,150
Damn!

186
00:10:44,010 --> 00:10:45,390
It's that kid again!

187
00:10:46,670 --> 00:10:49,330
Thanks to him, we have another big mess to
clean up.

188
00:10:49,710 --> 00:10:52,886
Yeah, and he doesn't even have any parents
that we can go and complain to about it.

189
00:10:52,910 --> 00:10:53,510
What'll we do?

190
00:10:53,790 --> 00:10:55,810
Who's going to pay to get all of this
cleaned up?

191
00:10:58,670 --> 00:11:01,350
Who can we complain to, you know?

192
00:11:04,350 --> 00:11:06,170
It was him again, wasn't it?

193
00:11:06,430 --> 00:11:08,650
Yeah, the boy we're not supposed to talk
about.

194
00:11:12,420 --> 00:11:13,620
That kid's a nuisance.

195
00:11:14,260 --> 00:11:15,240
He's so unpleasant.

196
00:11:15,241 --> 00:11:16,900
More like useless.

197
00:11:25,220 --> 00:11:26,780
See you later!

198
00:11:28,215 --> 00:11:29,680
Wait, your lunch!

199
00:11:30,360 --> 00:11:31,360
Oops, thanks.

200
00:11:31,900 --> 00:11:33,500
What did you put in there for me anyway?

201
00:11:34,100 --> 00:11:35,500
I said I wanted an omelet!

202
00:11:35,760 --> 00:11:37,700
Well, good, because that's what I made you
both.

203
00:11:39,240 --> 00:11:40,840
You be careful!

204
00:11:40,841 --> 00:11:41,841
Okay!

205
00:11:56,580 --> 00:11:58,440
May I come in?

206
00:12:07,620 --> 00:12:09,540
Here's this month's allowance.

207
00:12:10,860 --> 00:12:12,800
Make sure you spend it wisely.

208
00:12:16,780 --> 00:12:17,780
Hold on.

209
00:12:22,780 --> 00:12:24,840
Tell me about them.

210
00:12:25,320 --> 00:12:27,060
Tell me all about my mom and dad.

211
00:12:30,500 --> 00:12:32,760
I'm certain that I told you before.

212
00:12:33,660 --> 00:12:35,360
Although it was quite some time ago.

213
00:12:35,400 --> 00:12:36,400
I don't mean that!

214
00:12:37,180 --> 00:12:40,240
You're talking about when the nine-tailed
fox ran amok, aren't you?

215
00:12:42,620 --> 00:12:45,500
I already know plenty about how it
attacked the village.

216
00:12:46,230 --> 00:12:48,680
And killed tons of people, including my
parents.

217
00:12:50,240 --> 00:12:53,220
But that stuff isn't what I'm asking you
to tell me about now!

218
00:12:54,060 --> 00:12:55,820
What I want to know is...

219
00:12:56,520 --> 00:12:58,560
Just who were my parents, really?

220
00:12:58,561 --> 00:13:00,560
What kind of people were they?

221
00:13:04,459 --> 00:13:07,160
There's no use in asking such questions.

222
00:13:07,600 --> 00:13:09,590
It won't bring back the dead.

223
00:14:24,699 --> 00:14:25,600
Look over there.

224
00:14:25,699 --> 00:14:27,000
Isn't he that boy?

225
00:14:27,659 --> 00:14:28,659
I think so.

226
00:14:40,999 --> 00:14:42,310
That's him, isn't it?

227
00:14:42,650 --> 00:14:44,430
That boy gives me the creeps.

228
00:14:45,420 --> 00:14:46,690
Hey, you see him?

229
00:14:47,300 --> 00:14:48,300
Don't play with that kid.

230
00:14:48,500 --> 00:14:49,860
You never know what he's gonna do.

231
00:15:03,604 --> 00:15:04,660
Is that guy right?

232
00:15:12,890 --> 00:15:14,790
Man, that looks good!

233
00:15:23,919 --> 00:15:26,850
Hey, Pops, give me an order of fried rice
and dumplings.

234
00:15:27,210 --> 00:15:28,210
You got it!

235
00:15:28,520 --> 00:15:30,650
An order of dumplings for me, too.

236
00:15:53,849 --> 00:15:55,490
What a weird kid.

237
00:15:57,090 --> 00:15:58,150
That was that boy.

238
00:16:00,369 --> 00:16:03,150
Did you hear the rumors that Lord Forth
died because of him?

239
00:16:08,300 --> 00:16:10,020
So that's him, huh?

240
00:16:17,060 --> 00:16:18,460
I'm home.

241
00:16:59,580 --> 00:17:00,980
What?

242
00:17:25,935 --> 00:17:26,960
Wow!

243
00:18:08,570 --> 00:18:09,570
Hey, Mom?

244
00:18:09,715 --> 00:18:10,530
Seconds, please.

245
00:18:10,710 --> 00:18:11,710
Sure thing.

246
00:18:13,179 --> 00:18:15,470
Big Brother said that you're going on a
trip somewhere.

247
00:18:15,985 --> 00:18:16,985
When do you leave?

248
00:18:17,649 --> 00:18:18,670
Yes, that's right.

249
00:18:19,369 --> 00:18:21,270
We're going to visit your mother's family.

250
00:18:23,170 --> 00:18:24,170
Oh.

251
00:18:28,929 --> 00:18:32,270
So Itachi told you all about our trip,
did he?

252
00:18:32,979 --> 00:18:35,350
I thought that we could go on my next day
off.

253
00:18:36,569 --> 00:18:37,569
You wanna come?

254
00:18:37,789 --> 00:18:40,230
I'm gonna have Big Brother teach me all
kinds of stuff.

255
00:18:41,919 --> 00:18:44,310
He said he'd teach you?

256
00:18:44,715 --> 00:18:45,715
Oh, yeah.

257
00:18:45,764 --> 00:18:46,930
He promised that he would.

258
00:18:48,255 --> 00:18:49,255
Itachi did?

259
00:18:49,335 --> 00:18:50,335
That's unusual.

260
00:18:50,704 --> 00:18:51,970
Oh, here's your rice, dear.

261
00:18:52,534 --> 00:18:54,490
Oh, could I trouble you for some tea?

262
00:18:55,050 --> 00:18:56,050
Sure.

263
00:19:10,830 --> 00:19:11,830
Hey!

264
00:19:30,220 --> 00:19:30,780
Here.

265
00:19:31,060 --> 00:19:32,060
Go on, Gramps.

266
00:19:32,160 --> 00:19:33,160
Eat up.

267
00:19:33,340 --> 00:19:36,280
Oh, thank you for sharing this.

268
00:19:36,940 --> 00:19:39,160
Oh, it looks really tasty.

269
00:19:41,609 --> 00:19:43,840
Yeah, well, I was the one who caught it.

270
00:19:44,660 --> 00:19:47,000
So, of course, it's gonna taste really
good.

271
00:19:49,960 --> 00:19:51,580
Oh, hot, hot!

272
00:19:52,175 --> 00:19:55,100
Just look at all those stars.

273
00:19:57,340 --> 00:20:02,000
Each one of them is a sun like the one
that shines down on our world.

274
00:20:04,214 --> 00:20:05,220
What do you think?

275
00:20:06,024 --> 00:20:08,260
The sheer amount is incredible,
eh?

276
00:20:08,760 --> 00:20:09,260
The sun?

277
00:20:09,615 --> 00:20:12,540
That giant thing that shines in the sky
during the day?

278
00:20:13,660 --> 00:20:14,660
That's right.

279
00:20:15,120 --> 00:20:16,960
The universe is limitless.

280
00:20:16,961 --> 00:20:18,200
Yeah?

281
00:20:19,440 --> 00:20:21,940
Wow, you sure know a lot of stuff,
Gramps.

282
00:20:23,300 --> 00:20:26,508
Compared to the
vastness of the world, the

283
00:20:26,509 --> 00:20:30,121
existence that each
person leads is insignificant.

284
00:20:31,500 --> 00:20:38,040
The things that we inconsequential humans
worry about are often very petty indeed.

285
00:20:39,760 --> 00:20:40,760
You're right.

286
00:20:41,520 --> 00:20:44,760
So this world is as big as all that,
huh?

287
00:20:48,019 --> 00:20:52,180
It seems like it just goes on and on.

288
00:21:06,660 --> 00:21:09,380
Hey, Gramps, do you want some mushroom
soup?

289
00:21:10,300 --> 00:21:12,520
Are you sure you can spare me some?

290
00:21:13,000 --> 00:21:13,240
Sure.

291
00:21:13,600 --> 00:21:16,100
You know, you tell great stories,
Gramps.

292
00:21:16,980 --> 00:21:17,980
I see.

293
00:21:18,720 --> 00:21:20,720
Are you sure these mushrooms are safe?

294
00:21:21,180 --> 00:21:22,720
Won't know till we eat them, you know.

295
00:21:23,100 --> 00:21:24,100
Yes, you're right.

296
00:21:35,844 --> 00:21:36,910
Now you try.

297
00:21:37,044 --> 00:21:38,150
Just like that.

298
00:21:41,794 --> 00:21:43,170
You've improved, Sasuke.

299
00:21:47,399 --> 00:21:49,190
I can throw better than Mom now.

300
00:21:50,090 --> 00:21:51,090
All right.

301
00:21:51,259 --> 00:21:52,259
How about this?

302
00:22:11,939 --> 00:22:13,650
Big Brother You're amazing, Big Brother.

303
00:22:15,259 --> 00:22:17,310
How'd you even get them to do that?

304
00:22:18,439 --> 00:22:20,130
You'll be throwing like that soon.

305
00:22:22,869 --> 00:22:25,090
You're quite a lot like me, you know that?

306
00:22:33,699 --> 00:22:37,190
Big Brother, can you teach me again
sometime, like today?

307
00:22:38,130 --> 00:22:39,130
Sure.

308
00:22:39,849 --> 00:22:40,890
When I have the time.

309
00:22:41,530 --> 00:22:42,530
You promise?

310
00:22:43,210 --> 00:22:44,210
Yeah.

311
00:22:47,139 --> 00:22:49,400
Do you know how the Uchiha Clan came
about?

312
00:22:50,480 --> 00:22:51,480
What?

313
00:22:51,859 --> 00:22:54,860
No, I haven't really learned about it too
much yet.

314
00:22:56,540 --> 00:23:00,820
The Uchiha Crest is the symbol and proof
of our prestigious clan.

315
00:23:01,640 --> 00:23:04,420
An image of a fan is prestigious?

316
00:23:06,140 --> 00:23:08,180
You need wind to start a fire,
right?

317
00:23:08,660 --> 00:23:10,620
You produce wind with a fan.

318
00:23:12,840 --> 00:23:15,280
And is that something amazing?

319
00:23:17,340 --> 00:23:20,400
Well, you'll come to understand in time.

320
00:23:23,140 --> 00:23:27,860
Big Brother, for the sake of the clan,
is that why you fight?

321
00:23:28,565 --> 00:23:29,660
I wonder.

322
00:23:31,240 --> 00:23:35,240
I'm not entirely sure about that just yet
either.

323
00:23:43,919 --> 00:23:47,860
All right, I'm gonna make us a big feast
tonight.

324
00:24:21,129 --> 00:24:22,129
Ooh, hot!

325
00:24:23,334 --> 00:24:26,740
You made all this just for the two of us?

326
00:24:27,549 --> 00:24:28,549
Uh, yeah.

327
00:24:29,274 --> 00:24:31,240
But maybe I went a little overboard.

328
00:24:34,594 --> 00:24:35,900
Yeah, just a little.

329
00:24:53,499 --> 00:24:54,850
I'm totally stuffed.

330
00:24:58,570 --> 00:25:01,070
Hey Sasuke, wanna sleep outside tonight?

331
00:25:02,609 --> 00:25:04,930
Are you sure it's okay for us to do that?

332
00:25:12,539 --> 00:25:13,539
Hey, careful!

333
00:25:13,984 --> 00:25:15,380
Don't be in such a rush!

334
00:25:16,745 --> 00:25:17,745
Ow!

335
00:25:22,800 --> 00:25:23,800
Are you cold?

336
00:25:24,650 --> 00:25:25,110
Uh-uh.

337
00:25:25,519 --> 00:25:26,830
It feels great out here.

338
00:25:33,739 --> 00:25:36,748
I really want to become a
skilled shinobi like you because

339
00:25:36,749 --> 00:25:39,500
that way I'll finally be able
to get Father's approval.

340
00:25:41,019 --> 00:25:42,340
You wanna be like me?

341
00:25:44,360 --> 00:25:45,360
No.

342
00:25:45,759 --> 00:25:46,880
You'll surpass me.

343
00:25:47,699 --> 00:25:48,699
That's impossible.

344
00:25:49,295 --> 00:25:49,920
No way.

345
00:25:50,280 --> 00:25:52,440
I mean, you're this super gifted genius.

346
00:25:53,404 --> 00:25:55,040
Everyone says that, you know.

347
00:25:57,465 --> 00:25:59,540
You know, you are a lot like me.

348
00:26:00,314 --> 00:26:01,740
You do have the potential.

349
00:26:02,520 --> 00:26:04,280
Okay then, I'll surpass you.

350
00:26:15,690 --> 00:26:16,690
Sasuke.

351
00:26:17,810 --> 00:26:18,250
Sasuke.

352
00:26:18,251 --> 00:26:19,251
Okay.

353
00:26:42,509 --> 00:26:43,509
Hey, Sakura.

354
00:26:44,849 --> 00:26:47,580
I was thinking, don't those bangs of yours
get in the way?

355
00:26:54,409 --> 00:26:56,180
You should just cut them off.

356
00:26:57,460 --> 00:26:59,080
Oh, don't start, dear.

357
00:27:00,069 --> 00:27:02,380
Girls have their reasons to do what they
do.

358
00:27:02,381 --> 00:27:07,760
If you say things like that to her,
then Sakura's going to start hating you.

359
00:27:40,820 --> 00:27:43,460
Oh, you like flowers, huh?

360
00:27:44,600 --> 00:27:45,600
Who?

361
00:27:46,460 --> 00:27:47,460
Oh.

362
00:27:49,760 --> 00:27:51,260
It's you, Ino.

363
00:27:52,469 --> 00:27:53,900
You like those cosmos flowers?

364
00:27:55,880 --> 00:28:00,640
Oh, uh, um, I guess so, yeah.

365
00:28:01,380 --> 00:28:02,940
Hey, here, take a look at this.

366
00:28:03,100 --> 00:28:04,100
Ta-da!

367
00:28:04,320 --> 00:28:05,540
Oh, how pretty.

368
00:28:06,120 --> 00:28:07,140
I know, right?

369
00:28:07,854 --> 00:28:09,880
I could tie your hair up with this if you
want.

370
00:28:10,780 --> 00:28:11,780
Huh?

371
00:28:11,940 --> 00:28:13,200
You want to tie up my hair?

372
00:28:19,380 --> 00:28:20,760
You're really cute, Sakura.

373
00:28:21,280 --> 00:28:22,320
Don't hide it.

374
00:28:23,720 --> 00:28:24,720
Now... there.

375
00:28:26,280 --> 00:28:28,620
This looks way better on you, don't you
think?

376
00:28:30,420 --> 00:28:35,400
But this way... it's just... my forehead
is a billboard brow.

377
00:28:38,080 --> 00:28:41,180
People only tease you because you try to
cover it up.

378
00:28:41,181 --> 00:28:44,200
Just flaunt it, and don't let them get to
you.

379
00:28:44,660 --> 00:28:46,720
Then everybody around you will change.

380
00:28:48,020 --> 00:28:50,180
But Ino, you're so strong, and I'm...

381
00:28:51,280 --> 00:28:55,760
I think that this is a much better look
for you, don't you?

382
00:28:56,400 --> 00:28:58,220
You've got a good sense of style.

383
00:28:58,604 --> 00:29:01,180
I think that you just need to have more
confidence.

384
00:29:04,034 --> 00:29:07,700
I, um, well, I think that I made a friend.

385
00:29:07,701 --> 00:29:12,380
Her name is Ino Yamanaka, and she's this
totally incredible person.

386
00:29:12,749 --> 00:29:15,820
She's cute, strong, fashionable,
and really kind, too.

387
00:29:18,719 --> 00:29:20,180
Wow, I see.

388
00:29:21,159 --> 00:29:22,960
You made a friend, Sakura?

389
00:29:25,370 --> 00:29:30,360
Well, if she's cute like you say,
then I would love to meet her.

390
00:29:31,000 --> 00:29:32,000
Oh, dear.

391
00:29:33,054 --> 00:29:34,940
Why would you say something like that?

392
00:29:36,099 --> 00:29:37,860
I'm really happy for you, Sakura.

393
00:29:38,509 --> 00:29:40,780
You have to make sure that you cherish
your friends.

394
00:29:42,139 --> 00:29:46,680
Always remember, in this life,
friends are your most precious assets.

395
00:29:47,600 --> 00:29:48,600
Okay.

396
00:29:48,914 --> 00:29:51,040
Ino even gave me this ribbon in my hair.

397
00:29:51,544 --> 00:29:53,200
And it looks great on you!

398
00:29:53,530 --> 00:29:56,960
You know, you're as cute as your mother
was when she was young.

399
00:29:57,215 --> 00:29:59,320
Oh, dear, don't embarrass me.

400
00:29:59,679 --> 00:30:01,540
Did you actually say that I'm cute?

401
00:30:03,760 --> 00:30:07,200
Sakura, while you're at it, you should
find a boyfriend, too.

402
00:30:07,201 --> 00:30:08,201
Dad, stop!

403
00:30:19,229 --> 00:30:20,730
Wow, that's amazing!

404
00:30:22,149 --> 00:30:23,790
You did this all by yourself?

405
00:30:24,439 --> 00:30:25,810
It's nothing, really.

406
00:30:26,639 --> 00:30:29,030
I mean, I'm not that creative.

407
00:30:29,690 --> 00:30:30,830
Not like you are.

408
00:30:34,390 --> 00:30:36,550
Although... Do you see this cosmos flower?

409
00:30:38,174 --> 00:30:42,870
To bring out its beauty more, the things
around it should complement it.

410
00:30:43,624 --> 00:30:46,010
So the elements of the arrangement don't
clash.

411
00:30:47,430 --> 00:30:47,870
Hold on.

412
00:30:48,264 --> 00:30:49,550
Let me try something, okay?

413
00:30:52,570 --> 00:30:53,570
Like... this.

414
00:30:54,990 --> 00:30:56,370
So... what do you think?

415
00:30:56,615 --> 00:30:57,290
How's it look?

416
00:30:57,504 --> 00:31:00,030
You know, there's this boy.

417
00:31:01,080 --> 00:31:03,550
And, well, I have a really big crush on
him.

418
00:31:03,551 --> 00:31:04,551
Oh, yeah?

419
00:31:04,970 --> 00:31:05,970
I had no idea.

420
00:31:06,369 --> 00:31:07,770
So who is this mystery boy?

421
00:31:09,454 --> 00:31:13,310
And is this the whole reason why you've
been acting so much more cheerful lately?

422
00:31:14,629 --> 00:31:16,130
Okay, all done!

423
00:31:16,670 --> 00:31:17,670
No, not really.

424
00:31:17,730 --> 00:31:19,210
Or at least I don't think so.

425
00:31:19,759 --> 00:31:21,550
But Sasuke is just...

426
00:31:22,819 --> 00:31:24,130
Oh, okay, I see.

427
00:31:24,719 --> 00:31:25,910
So it's Sasuke, huh?

428
00:31:26,529 --> 00:31:29,910
There's a rumor that Sasuke likes girls
who have long hair.

429
00:31:30,175 --> 00:31:32,911
And so I've been trying
to... Sorry, you know what?

430
00:31:33,109 --> 00:31:34,370
I just remembered something.

431
00:31:34,509 --> 00:31:35,670
I'll come again later.

432
00:31:35,930 --> 00:31:36,170
Hey, wait!

433
00:31:36,750 --> 00:31:37,750
Ino!

434
00:31:39,030 --> 00:31:40,370
Thank you for today!

435
00:32:13,140 --> 00:32:14,940
All right.

436
00:32:15,600 --> 00:32:17,720
I believe that will do for today.

437
00:32:20,160 --> 00:32:21,160
No!

438
00:32:22,040 --> 00:32:23,040
Please, Father.

439
00:32:23,620 --> 00:32:26,180
I can still keep going with today's
training.

440
00:32:30,560 --> 00:32:33,760
Meiji, don't overdo it.

441
00:32:34,634 --> 00:32:38,560
But, considering your age, you've gotten
strong.

442
00:32:39,340 --> 00:32:43,780
Father, thank you for that and also for
sparring with me.

443
00:32:53,090 --> 00:32:58,750
Oh, Father.

444
00:32:59,759 --> 00:33:01,790
There's something I've been meaning to ask
you.

445
00:33:01,934 --> 00:33:04,990
I've heard my uncle, your older brother,
has a child like me.

446
00:33:05,090 --> 00:33:06,090
Is that true?

447
00:33:06,150 --> 00:33:07,150
Yes.

448
00:33:07,370 --> 00:33:07,710
A girl.

449
00:33:08,239 --> 00:33:09,670
She's one year younger than you.

450
00:33:10,759 --> 00:33:11,759
A girl, huh?

451
00:33:11,809 --> 00:33:14,130
We're going to her third birthday
celebration tomorrow.

452
00:33:15,709 --> 00:33:17,290
I wonder what she's like.

453
00:33:20,039 --> 00:33:22,390
Father, take a look.

454
00:33:23,199 --> 00:33:24,390
It's starting to snow.

455
00:33:25,750 --> 00:33:26,750
Wow!

456
00:33:28,739 --> 00:33:29,790
The year's first.

457
00:33:31,169 --> 00:33:32,490
Looks like it'll be heavy.

458
00:33:47,729 --> 00:33:50,690
Lady Hinata, congratulations on your third
birthday.

459
00:33:51,890 --> 00:33:52,890
Lady Hinata?

460
00:33:53,239 --> 00:33:55,010
She's a really cute kid.

461
00:33:58,099 --> 00:33:59,819
Meiji, there's something that you must
know.

462
00:34:00,219 --> 00:34:03,670
It's your destiny to protect her and the
Hyuga bloodline.

463
00:34:05,330 --> 00:34:07,470
The Hyuga bloodline?

464
00:34:12,790 --> 00:34:13,790
Father!

465
00:34:47,390 --> 00:34:48,870
Meiji is very strong.

466
00:34:49,949 --> 00:34:53,690
You know, back when the two of us lived
only for the sake of Lady Hinata.

467
00:34:54,310 --> 00:34:55,630
That's the Hyuga destiny.

468
00:35:04,380 --> 00:35:05,380
Good!

469
00:35:05,780 --> 00:35:06,840
That will do for today.

470
00:35:08,164 --> 00:35:09,860
Meiji, you're indeed strong.

471
00:35:10,510 --> 00:35:12,680
And Hinata, you still have a ways to go.

472
00:35:13,664 --> 00:35:15,960
Well, my father's daily lessons are...

473
00:35:18,970 --> 00:35:22,140
I don't like practicing Taijutsu.

474
00:35:22,795 --> 00:35:24,260
What are you even talking about?

475
00:35:24,390 --> 00:35:26,120
You're the successor of the Hyuga clan.

476
00:35:26,305 --> 00:35:27,520
You're very important.

477
00:35:28,730 --> 00:35:31,200
You have to be more positive and
confident.

478
00:35:33,170 --> 00:35:36,840
I wish that I could switch places with
you, big brother.

479
00:35:37,710 --> 00:35:38,820
You're so strong.

480
00:35:40,034 --> 00:35:42,600
No, you must never say anything such as
that.

481
00:35:43,134 --> 00:35:45,380
Now listen, I will make you strong.

482
00:35:45,870 --> 00:35:48,900
If you're in danger, I'll give my life to
protect you.

483
00:35:53,020 --> 00:35:54,140
Brother Meiji...

484
00:35:54,960 --> 00:35:56,980
Lady Hinata, it's snowing!

485
00:35:58,750 --> 00:36:02,020
Today, I got to have a snowball fight with
my father.

486
00:36:02,460 --> 00:36:04,320
And I was even able to hit him twice!

487
00:36:25,400 --> 00:36:31,540
Let's see, the symbol on the far right
belongs to us, the Akimichi clan, right?

488
00:36:31,630 --> 00:36:33,120
And the other two are...

489
00:36:34,570 --> 00:36:39,140
The middle one is the Nara clans, and
the leftmost one is the Yamanaka clans.

490
00:36:39,389 --> 00:36:42,240
Three clans that use highly unusual secret
ninjutsu.

491
00:36:43,340 --> 00:36:45,919
We've been combining our
powers for many generations

492
00:36:45,920 --> 00:36:48,361
now, and the three clans
share a special relationship.

493
00:36:51,100 --> 00:36:54,088
To strengthen our union
and protect our clans, the

494
00:36:54,089 --> 00:36:57,020
Sarutobi clan bestows ear
piercings upon the three of us.

495
00:36:57,340 --> 00:37:01,600
And every generation, the members of our
clan swear an oath of loyalty on those

496
00:37:01,601 --> 00:37:04,240
earrings, so they're not just mere
decorations, son.

497
00:37:06,100 --> 00:37:07,240
You mean these?

498
00:37:07,460 --> 00:37:10,240
I saw that the other clan leaders also
wear them.

499
00:37:10,560 --> 00:37:12,560
It must hurt to get your ears pierced.

500
00:37:13,500 --> 00:37:16,500
We wear these piercings so the message
sinks in deep.

501
00:37:16,760 --> 00:37:19,380
They constantly remind us of the oaths we
swore.

502
00:37:20,000 --> 00:37:22,660
And you're eventually going to have to
have it done too, Choji.

503
00:37:23,200 --> 00:37:23,520
What?

504
00:37:23,960 --> 00:37:24,960
But why?

505
00:37:25,180 --> 00:37:29,140
From the time my child becomes a Genin,
until he or she finally achieves Chunin

506
00:37:29,141 --> 00:37:32,840
status, I am to follow custom and pass on
my piercings to him or her.

507
00:37:33,160 --> 00:37:35,552
It's a practice that's
intended to teach one's child

508
00:37:35,553 --> 00:37:38,340
all about the oaths
that one day, they'll take.

509
00:37:38,805 --> 00:37:40,880
Yeah, but I really don't like pain.

510
00:37:50,960 --> 00:37:51,960
He's Zashi.

511
00:37:52,420 --> 00:37:53,420
Neji's only four.

512
00:37:53,794 --> 00:37:55,460
Oh, it's such a pity.

513
00:38:08,295 --> 00:38:09,920
Big Brother Neji...

514
00:39:02,300 --> 00:39:02,820
Hey!

515
00:39:03,260 --> 00:39:04,260
What are you doing?

516
00:39:06,900 --> 00:39:09,260
What are you doing out here in the snow
like this?

517
00:39:11,340 --> 00:39:14,460
And if you just keep crying, how am I
gonna find out?

518
00:39:16,794 --> 00:39:17,794
I...

519
00:39:19,420 --> 00:39:20,420
I...

520
00:39:27,140 --> 00:39:29,110
Listen, where's your house?

521
00:39:29,794 --> 00:39:32,310
Oh, come on now.

522
00:39:32,480 --> 00:39:34,310
Look, let's go.

523
00:39:48,420 --> 00:39:50,330
Wow, look at this place.

524
00:39:50,880 --> 00:39:54,450
You live in a big house like this,
and you're out here crying?

525
00:39:57,880 --> 00:39:58,880
I'm alone.

526
00:39:59,674 --> 00:40:02,290
I don't have anyone, but I never cry.

527
00:40:02,754 --> 00:40:05,490
I mean, for real, I never, ever cry.

528
00:40:15,160 --> 00:40:16,160
Bye!

529
00:40:20,780 --> 00:40:21,780
Hinata!

530
00:40:23,855 --> 00:40:25,680
You're the heir to the main family.

531
00:40:25,754 --> 00:40:26,760
You're very important.

532
00:40:26,899 --> 00:40:28,960
Just what do you think you're doing out
here?

533
00:40:30,280 --> 00:40:34,130
I... For your sake, and
for the sake of the main

534
00:40:34,131 --> 00:40:37,580
family, many people have
made the ultimate sacrifice.

535
00:40:38,554 --> 00:40:41,320
It's time that you learned about such
things, young lady.

536
00:41:00,020 --> 00:41:01,300
Here goes!

537
00:41:02,240 --> 00:41:03,240
Pops away!

538
00:41:09,840 --> 00:41:10,840
Bullseye!

539
00:41:11,020 --> 00:41:13,480
Operation Red Nose Hokage is complete!

540
00:41:15,920 --> 00:41:17,040
He's incorrigible.

541
00:41:18,120 --> 00:41:21,360
Lord Hokage, please, I... I need to think
about this.

542
00:41:21,900 --> 00:41:24,180
I don't know about becoming Naruto's
teacher.

543
00:41:25,460 --> 00:41:30,740
As you know, nearly every single person in
this village is troubled by Naruto's

544
00:41:30,741 --> 00:41:32,869
mischief, and his irksome
pranks are becoming

545
00:41:32,870 --> 00:41:35,461
more and more troublesome
each and every day.

546
00:41:36,020 --> 00:41:38,300
No one wants to take him on as a student.

547
00:41:39,320 --> 00:41:43,680
I believe that a teacher's job is to
enhance each student's inherent virtues.

548
00:41:47,000 --> 00:41:50,276
Now listen, if Naruto
isn't able to graduate

549
00:41:50,277 --> 00:41:53,241
from the academy, he
cannot become a ninja.

550
00:41:53,940 --> 00:41:57,100
He'll remain an outcast in this village
for the rest of his life.

551
00:41:57,700 --> 00:41:59,840
Surely someone else is a better fit?

552
00:42:00,220 --> 00:42:02,616
If he cannot find a
teacher, then I'll have no

553
00:42:02,617 --> 00:42:05,400
other choice but to expel
Naruto from the academy.

554
00:42:08,440 --> 00:42:10,060
Just forget about it.

555
00:42:10,460 --> 00:42:13,719
No one's going to blame you
for how you feel, and even if we

556
00:42:13,720 --> 00:42:16,740
do have to kick him out, it
certainly wouldn't be your fault.

557
00:42:16,940 --> 00:42:18,000
Please, wait.

558
00:42:18,600 --> 00:42:19,080
What's that?

559
00:42:19,400 --> 00:42:21,200
Then you've decided to take the job?

560
00:42:21,800 --> 00:42:23,340
Uh, well, fine.

561
00:42:23,980 --> 00:42:24,980
Oh, excellent.

562
00:42:25,220 --> 00:42:26,600
That's really good to hear.

563
00:42:27,400 --> 00:42:30,280
You've no idea how much good this will do
Naruto.

564
00:42:38,080 --> 00:42:41,200
And keep wiping until every speck of that
graffiti is gone!

565
00:42:42,220 --> 00:42:44,260
Look, it's that... that kid.

566
00:42:45,250 --> 00:42:48,120
Why do they even let that boy stay in the
village anyway?

567
00:42:48,324 --> 00:42:51,200
