571
00:42:59,390 --> 00:43:00,660
I'm Naruto Uzumaki!

572
00:43:01,459 --> 00:43:03,520
And I'm going to be Hokage one day!

573
00:43:23,820 --> 00:43:25,060
It was just a dream.

574
00:44:01,840 --> 00:44:02,910
Oh yeah, that's right.

575
00:44:03,070 --> 00:44:04,970
Almost forgot, I start a new class today.

576
00:44:05,564 --> 00:44:08,750
Well, you never get a second chance to
make a good first impression.

577
00:44:09,334 --> 00:44:11,670
