595
00:45:22,784 --> 00:45:26,210
Starting today, I'm your new homeroom
teacher, Iruka Umino.

596
00:45:27,150 --> 00:45:29,250
My favorite food is Ichiraku Ramen.

597
00:45:29,510 --> 00:45:31,690
And my least favorite food is mixed rice.

598
00:45:32,330 --> 00:45:35,030
I was born on May 26th, so I'm a Gemini.

599
00:45:35,639 --> 00:45:36,639
Therefore,

600
00:45:39,830 --> 00:45:44,070
a person's chakra is greatly influenced by
that person's mental energy.

601
00:45:52,490 --> 00:45:53,610
