610
00:46:23,180 --> 00:46:25,540
That makes prank number three!

611
00:46:29,000 --> 00:46:31,220
Boy, that's smart.

612
00:46:31,640 --> 00:46:33,380
But how did you figure it out so quickly?

613
00:46:34,154 --> 00:46:35,620
Just return to your seat.

614
00:46:36,034 --> 00:46:37,620
And we'll continue.

615
00:46:44,640 --> 00:46:45,660
All right, everyone.

616
00:46:46,240 --> 00:46:48,443
Instead of just introducing
yourselves, I want each

617
00:46:48,444 --> 00:46:50,820
of you to demonstrate
your skill with Ninjutsu.

618
00:46:54,450 --> 00:46:56,680
Don't worry, you're not going to be graded
on this.

619
00:46:57,094 --> 00:46:59,308
It's merely so I can assess
where you are in your

620
00:46:59,309 --> 00:47:01,821
studies and plan how to
proceed with our lessons.

621
00:47:02,029 --> 00:47:05,200
Okay, we'll start off with a basic clone
jutsu then.

622
00:47:05,964 --> 00:47:08,180
And the first up...

623
00:47:09,340 --> 00:47:10,800
