678
00:49:03,780 --> 00:49:04,780
Sensei.

679
00:49:07,100 --> 00:49:08,280
Leave him alone.

680
00:49:09,034 --> 00:49:10,120
Just ignore him.

681
00:49:10,960 --> 00:49:11,960
Huh?

682
00:49:20,920 --> 00:49:21,960
All right, everyone.

683
00:49:22,280 --> 00:49:22,740
Come on.

684
00:49:23,049 --> 00:49:24,760
We still have a class to finish.

685
00:49:25,080 --> 00:49:26,720
