688
00:49:55,500 --> 00:49:56,500
All right.

689
00:50:00,340 --> 00:50:01,600
Elder Sister Hinata.

690
00:50:02,720 --> 00:50:04,380
I've been waiting for you.

691
00:50:04,940 --> 00:50:05,580
Now come on.

692
00:50:05,720 --> 00:50:06,900
Let's go and play ninja.

693
00:50:09,240 --> 00:50:10,600
