698
00:50:18,120 --> 00:50:21,120
Lady Hinata is scheduled to train with
Lord Hiyashi now.

699
00:50:22,140 --> 00:50:23,220
But I'll play with you.

700
00:50:24,740 --> 00:50:26,300
Please be on your way.

701
00:50:26,640 --> 00:50:27,640
Okay.

702
00:50:27,940 --> 00:50:28,960
See you later, Hanabi.

703
00:50:30,000 --> 00:50:30,360
No!

704
00:50:30,760 --> 00:50:30,920
No!

705
00:50:31,100 --> 00:50:32,100
Don't go!

706
00:50:32,200 --> 00:50:33,200
Elder Sister!

707
