This is boring.

708
00:50:42,000 --> 00:50:44,060
Well, I'm sorry, but it can't be helped.

709
00:50:44,620 --> 00:50:47,220
Lady Hinata is the successor of the main
family.

710
00:50:48,740 --> 00:50:50,520
Yeah, but she could play a little.

711
00:50:51,120 --> 00:50:53,000
The hyuga is a distinguished clan.

712
00:50:53,340 --> 00:50:55,840
Within the leaf were the
only ones who possessed

713
00:50:55,841 --> 00:50:58,541
the Byakugan, the most
touted of the Kekkei Genkai.

714
00:50:58,800 --> 00:51:01,824
As the future leader of
the clan, Lady Hinata has a

715
00:51:01,825 --> 00:51:04,220
veritable mountain of
knowledge that she must learn.

716
00:51:04,860 --> 00:51:06,220
Now, here you go.

717
00:51:23,060 --> 00:51:24,260
Lady Hanabi!

718
00:51:25,934 --> 00:51:27,220
Lady Hanabi!

719
00:51:29,600 --> 00:51:33,040
Oh dear, where in the world could she have
run off to?

720
00:51:40,500 --> 00:51:42,430
