I didn't get to play with Elder Sister at
all today.

722
00:52:10,240 --> 00:52:11,580
Elder Sister Hinata!

723
00:52:12,715 --> 00:52:14,140
I'm sorry that I'm late.

724
00:52:15,340 --> 00:52:16,340
Not at all!

725
