727
00:53:03,080 --> 00:53:04,080
Damn it!

728
00:53:04,120 --> 00:53:04,460
Damn it!

729
00:53:04,660 --> 00:53:04,960
Damn it!

730
00:53:05,120 --> 00:53:05,380
Damn it!

731
00:53:05,600 --> 00:53:05,740
Damn it!

732
00:53:05,860 --> 00:53:06,860
Damn it!

733
00:53:11,100 --> 00:53:13,420
Oh man, come on!

734
00:53:17,520 --> 00:53:19,080
Joji too?

735
00:53:24,780 --> 00:53:26,020
Damn it!

736
00:53:26,340 --> 00:53:29,200
Today is going to be the day I beat him
for sure!

737
00:53:29,700 --> 00:53:30,180
Definitely!

738
00:53:30,700 --> 00:53:30,700
Definitely!

739
00:53:31,260 --> 00:53:31,440
Definitely!

740
00:53:32,180 --> 00:53:34,180
I will beat him!

741
00:53:34,640 --> 00:53:38,280
Alright, it's Naruto Uzumaki vs Sasuke
Uchiha-Come on!

742
00:53:38,300 --> 00:53:39,640
Let's just do this, idiot!

743
00:53:39,900 --> 00:53:41,100
Hey, stop that, Naruto!

744
00:53:41,480 --> 00:53:44,360
You need to make the proper spar sign
before you two begin.

745
00:53:44,820 --> 00:53:45,860
It's simple etiquette.

746
00:53:46,140 --> 00:53:47,620
I don't care about any of that stuff!

747
00:53:47,900 --> 00:53:50,560
I just want to hurry up and defeat this
jerk already!

748
00:53:51,000 --> 00:53:53,860
It's time for a new Mr. Popular around
here, you know?

749
