779
00:55:16,770 --> 00:55:16,540
..

780
00:55:19,500 --> 00:55:20,500
Sasuke...

781
00:55:20,610 --> 00:55:22,200
That look in his eyes...

782
00:55:22,900 --> 00:55:25,780
It's the same look that everyone gives me.

783
00:55:28,580 --> 00:55:31,800
No... No, it's
stronger than that.

784
00:55:34,320 --> 00:55:35,320
Wait...

785
00:55:40,300 --> 00:55:41,430
It's not for me...

786
00:55:47,020 --> 00:55:48,420
Mani pisses me off!

787
00:55:49,084 --> 00:55:50,360
I'll show them!

788
00:55:50,620 --> 00:55:51,620
I'll show them all!

789
00:55:51,780 --> 00:55:53,480
I'm just as good as they are!

790
00:55:54,660 --> 00:55:55,660
Clone jutsu!

791
