806
00:56:43,874 --> 00:56:45,070
It's nothing really.

807
00:56:45,330 --> 00:56:46,550
I'm the same as always.

808
00:57:08,950 --> 00:57:09,950
All right, kids.

809
00:57:10,384 --> 00:57:12,830
Today, we're hands-on with Shuriken Jutsu.

810
00:57:13,620 --> 00:57:16,150
First, let's have someone demonstrate it
for us.

811
00:57:16,475 --> 00:57:18,890
Let's see... Um... Ooh!

812
00:57:19,050 --> 00:57:19,210
Ooh!

813
00:57:19,290 --> 00:57:19,490
Ooh!

814
00:57:19,491 --> 00:57:20,090
Yo, right here!

815
00:57:20,430 --> 00:57:20,810
Leave it to me!

816
00:57:20,830 --> 00:57:21,110
I can do it!

817
00:57:21,111 --> 00:57:21,190
Hit me!

818
00:57:21,191 --> 00:57:21,970
I'll do it in one try!

819
00:57:21,971 --> 00:57:22,570
I knew it!

820
00:57:22,765 --> 00:57:23,770
Come on, give me a shot!

821
00:57:23,771 --> 00:57:23,990
I'm right here!

822
00:57:24,170 --> 00:57:25,030
Oh, come on!

823
00:57:25,070 --> 00:57:25,510
What will you do?

824
00:57:25,630 --> 00:57:27,270
Shino, you go ahead.

825
00:57:29,250 --> 00:57:32,550
Iruka-sensei, I'm afraid you've chosen the
wrong person for this.

826
00:57:32,955 --> 00:57:34,530
The Shuriken Jutsu is not so good.

827
00:57:34,531 --> 00:57:36,450
This is something the Aburame Clan
practices.

828
00:57:37,170 --> 00:57:41,270
For all forms of warfare, we rely almost
exclusively on parasitic insects.

829
00:57:42,050 --> 00:57:44,070
We house them inside
our bodies... Okay, Shino!

830
00:57:44,250 --> 00:57:44,790
That's enough!

831
00:57:45,164 --> 00:57:47,330
Come on, Sasuke, please just show us the
basics.

832
00:57:55,740 --> 00:57:57,120
He's so full of himself!

833
00:57:57,420 --> 00:57:59,580
Since when does acting stuck-up make you
popular?

834
00:57:59,581 --> 00:58:00,660
Yeah, way to

835
00:58:03,950 --> 00:58:04,950
go!

836
00:58:08,750 --> 00:58:09,970
Well done, Sasuke.

837
00:58:10,129 --> 00:58:11,230
Excellent example.

838
00:58:11,444 --> 00:58:13,150
Sasuke, you are so cool!

839
00:58:13,450 --> 00:58:14,450
He's so cool!

840
00:58:14,830 --> 00:58:15,310
Ha!

841
00:58:15,311 --> 00:58:16,990
Suck-up and a show-off!

842
00:58:17,154 --> 00:58:19,790
I could do that too if I wanted to,
you know.

843
00:58:20,025 --> 00:58:22,610
All right, then I guess you're up next,
Naruto.

844
00:58:22,950 --> 00:58:23,170
Sweet!

845
00:58:23,424 --> 00:58:24,750
I'll show you how it's done!

846
00:58:24,870 --> 00:58:26,310
Get ready to be amazed!

847
00:58:34,859 --> 00:58:36,450
I gotta do it in one throw too.

848
00:58:36,879 --> 00:58:39,470
That'll make everyone sit up and finally
take notice.

849
00:58:42,470 --> 00:58:43,470
Let's go!

850
00:58:55,160 --> 00:58:56,400
What a joke!

851
00:58:56,640 --> 00:58:58,380
That's the worst attempt I've ever seen!

852
00:59:00,020 --> 00:59:02,740
Yeah, I was just fooling around,
you guys!

853
00:59:06,884 --> 00:59:09,600
Sensei, you just gotta let me try one more
time!

854
00:59:09,680 --> 00:59:10,680
You just gotta!

855
00:59:11,020 --> 00:59:12,020
I can do this!

856
00:59:12,060 --> 00:59:13,400
No, that's enough.

857
00:59:14,964 --> 00:59:17,840
Okay, which one of you wants to give it a
shot next?

858
00:59:26,620 --> 00:59:27,620
Damn it!

859
00:59:27,980 --> 00:59:29,800
Where'd that little brat run off to this
time?

860
00:59:34,945 --> 00:59:36,020
Serves you right!

861
00:59:37,940 --> 00:59:38,940
Huh?

862
01:00:22,320 --> 01:00:25,860
Hey, did you know that everyone in the
Uchiha clan was killed?

863
01:00:26,440 --> 01:00:28,940
Yeah, I heard my father talking about it a
while ago.

864
01:00:29,460 --> 01:00:31,440
Sasuke's the only one who survived!

865
01:00:46,880 --> 01:00:47,880
Yeah!

866
01:00:47,960 --> 01:00:48,960
Let's go!

867
01:00:50,940 --> 01:00:52,020
Oh, hey guys!

868
01:00:52,160 --> 01:00:53,160
So, what's the story?

869
01:00:53,220 --> 01:00:54,580
What are you doing this afternoon?

870
01:00:55,060 --> 01:00:56,060
Nothing with you.

871
01:00:56,160 --> 01:00:57,160
Get lost, Naruto!

872
01:00:57,660 --> 01:00:58,720
Ah, come on!

873
01:00:58,760 --> 01:01:00,040
We'll have lots of fun together!

874
01:01:00,700 --> 01:01:03,200
Just let me hang out with you guys,
and you'll see!

875
01:01:03,840 --> 01:01:04,300
No way!

876
01:01:04,440 --> 01:01:05,020
Forget it!

877
01:01:05,360 --> 01:01:08,100
Not now, and not tonight for the test of
courage, either.

878
01:01:08,400 --> 01:01:09,860
The test of courage?!

879
01:01:10,900 --> 01:01:12,460
Why'd you have to tell them about that?

880
01:01:13,160 --> 01:01:13,560
Wow!

881
01:01:13,944 --> 01:01:14,800
Sounds like fun!

882
01:01:14,880 --> 01:01:16,700
Just tell me where to go, and I'll be
there!

883
01:01:17,060 --> 01:01:19,140
We told you you can't come with us!

884
01:01:19,500 --> 01:01:19,960
Got it!

885
01:01:20,115 --> 01:01:21,420
And don't try to follow us!

886
01:01:21,980 --> 01:01:22,980
Come on, guys!

887
01:01:38,610 --> 01:01:39,810
Got it!

888
01:01:40,030 --> 01:01:41,390
And don't try to follow us!

889
01:01:42,659 --> 01:01:44,870
Is that the boy everyone talks about?

890
01:01:45,230 --> 01:01:45,690
Which one?

891
01:01:46,154 --> 01:01:47,390
Yeah, that's him.

892
01:01:56,220 --> 01:02:00,450
Hey, you little brat!

893
01:02:01,680 --> 01:02:02,730
Get out of here!

894
01:02:05,400 --> 01:02:06,170
You know what?

895
01:02:06,334 --> 01:02:07,250
Elder sister can't help you.

896
01:02:07,251 --> 01:02:08,491
She came to visit me yesterday.

897
01:02:09,054 --> 01:02:11,410
With her training, she must be tired.

898
01:02:12,060 --> 01:02:13,750
I hope you thanked her properly.

899
01:02:15,970 --> 01:02:16,970
I couldn't.

900
01:02:17,070 --> 01:02:18,070
She fell asleep.

901
01:02:19,110 --> 01:02:19,630
Okay.

902
01:02:20,130 --> 01:02:21,430
But thank her next time.

903
01:02:21,944 --> 01:02:23,730
Hey, what's the big idea, buddy?

904
01:02:24,780 --> 01:02:26,250
I don't want you here.

905
01:02:26,325 --> 01:02:27,490
You're nothing but a pest!

906
01:02:28,210 --> 01:02:29,870
But I wasn't even doing anything!

907
01:02:30,590 --> 01:02:33,850
I mean, I was just looking at the masks
you have.

908
01:02:34,600 --> 01:02:38,030
Why, you pathetic little loser!

909
01:02:39,070 --> 01:02:40,630
Here, is this what you want?

910
01:02:44,960 --> 01:02:46,690
Then just take it and get lost.

911
01:02:46,930 --> 01:02:48,110
And don't come back!

912
01:02:51,470 --> 01:02:52,470
Natsu?

913
01:02:52,890 --> 01:02:54,030
Who's that boy?

914
01:02:55,430 --> 01:02:56,910
Oh, well...

915
01:02:57,690 --> 01:02:59,870
It's like the shopkeeper said.

916
01:03:02,410 --> 01:03:03,410
Just stop!

917
01:03:04,290 --> 01:03:05,290
Alright?

918
01:03:05,750 --> 01:03:07,690
Just stop looking at me like that!

919
01:03:10,090 --> 01:03:11,090
Listen closely.

920
01:03:11,265 --> 01:03:13,310
You must never go near that boy,
okay?

921
01:03:22,330 --> 01:03:24,280
Oh, is it study time?

922
01:03:24,519 --> 01:03:25,519
Uh-huh!

923
01:03:25,730 --> 01:03:27,400
I can write my whole name now!

924
01:03:27,790 --> 01:03:29,120
I even know some kanji!

925
01:03:29,880 --> 01:03:30,160
Look!

926
01:03:30,540 --> 01:03:31,260
Lots, actually!

927
01:03:31,460 --> 01:03:31,920
Really?

928
01:03:32,474 --> 01:03:35,240
Lady Hinata, don't keep Lord Hiyashi
waiting.

929
01:03:35,600 --> 01:03:36,600
Right.

930
01:03:37,650 --> 01:03:38,800
See you later, Hanabi!

931
01:03:38,950 --> 01:03:39,950
Okay!

932
01:03:46,290 --> 01:03:47,690
She's training, huh?

933
01:03:59,990 --> 01:04:00,990
Focus, please.

934
01:04:02,050 --> 01:04:04,790
You can't go out to play until you've
finished your work.

935
01:04:36,300 --> 01:04:38,580
So strong, yet so kind.

936
01:04:39,420 --> 01:04:41,340
I want to be just like her.

937
01:04:50,620 --> 01:04:54,940
I want to be more like Elder Sister,
even if it's just a little bit.

938
01:05:01,550 --> 01:05:02,550
Ah!

939
01:05:04,110 --> 01:05:05,110
Elder Brother Neji?

940
01:05:05,645 --> 01:05:08,030
Why do I have to be her sparring partner?

941
01:05:08,424 --> 01:05:10,590
Please just let me train on my own.

942
01:05:11,150 --> 01:05:11,510
No.

943
01:05:12,010 --> 01:05:13,010
Not yet.

944
01:05:13,370 --> 01:05:13,710
Continue.

945
01:05:14,294 --> 01:05:15,310
Let's keep going!

946
01:05:15,774 --> 01:05:16,774
Please, Neji!

947
01:05:21,300 --> 01:05:22,390
Very well, then.

948
01:05:31,009 --> 01:05:33,120
He's acting different today.

949
01:05:34,305 --> 01:05:35,820
What's wrong, Lady Hinata?

950
01:05:36,790 --> 01:05:38,860
This isn't child's play now.

951
01:05:48,694 --> 01:05:50,160
Hang in there, Elder Sister.

952
01:05:53,640 --> 01:05:56,040
So... That was nothing!

953
01:05:58,120 --> 01:06:00,800
And you expect to fulfill your destiny?

954
01:06:02,850 --> 01:06:04,340
As leader of the Hyuga?

955
01:06:13,500 --> 01:06:14,900
Ah!

956
01:06:22,720 --> 01:06:25,660
What is it?

957
01:06:26,900 --> 01:06:28,140
My head!

958
01:06:43,100 --> 01:06:45,320
The brazen fool!

959
01:06:47,030 --> 01:06:49,080
What is going on?

960
01:07:03,770 --> 01:07:04,830
What

961
01:07:27,780 --> 01:07:29,490
is she doing out here?

962
01:07:37,050 --> 01:07:37,430
Okay!

963
01:07:37,690 --> 01:07:38,690
Clone Jutsu!

964
01:07:48,100 --> 01:07:49,700
Clone Jutsu!

965
01:07:51,000 --> 01:07:52,640
Wasn't he the one?

966
01:07:53,320 --> 01:07:55,640
Why is Elder Sister here with him?

967
01:07:57,240 --> 01:07:58,420
Elder Sister?

968
01:08:23,029 --> 01:08:24,029
Ah!

969
01:08:24,090 --> 01:08:24,350
Ah!

970
01:08:25,010 --> 01:08:26,010
Ah!

971
01:08:37,310 --> 01:08:38,560
I'm coming in.

972
01:09:03,200 --> 01:09:03,640
Sheesh!

973
01:09:03,760 --> 01:09:05,399
Some test of courage, you cowards!

974
01:09:05,505 --> 01:09:08,220
None of you wimps is brave enough to go
all the way in?

975
01:09:09,740 --> 01:09:11,720
You don't have to call us names,
you know.

976
01:09:12,000 --> 01:09:12,439
Whatever.

977
01:09:12,660 --> 01:09:13,660
Move it, loser.

978
01:09:25,750 --> 01:09:27,460
This isn't so bad, I guess.

979
01:09:32,610 --> 01:09:35,080
All I have to do is take one of those
sticks.

980
01:09:38,279 --> 01:09:39,279
Ah!

981
01:09:45,859 --> 01:09:47,460
It's a monster box!

982
01:09:52,580 --> 01:09:54,660
What in the world is going on?

983
01:09:54,720 --> 01:09:56,280
We saw a monster box!

984
01:09:56,440 --> 01:09:57,440
What?

985
01:10:15,970 --> 01:10:17,190
Serves them right!

986
01:10:17,370 --> 01:10:19,930
Those chickens all got scared and ran off!

987
01:10:20,130 --> 01:10:20,310
Ha!

988
01:10:20,530 --> 01:10:23,170
You better run, Sensei, or the fox will
get you too!

989
01:10:28,320 --> 01:10:29,500
Did you hear the news?

990
01:10:29,860 --> 01:10:31,180
The advance troops were defeated.

991
01:10:32,100 --> 01:10:32,380
No.

992
01:10:33,000 --> 01:10:34,100
They're all dead then?

993
01:10:34,540 --> 01:10:34,800
What?

994
01:10:34,940 --> 01:10:37,080
The advance troops are... are all dead?

995
01:10:37,880 --> 01:10:38,900
It's not true.

996
01:10:41,325 --> 01:10:42,325
It can't be true.

997
01:10:43,165 --> 01:10:44,940
My mom and dad can't be dead.

998
01:10:45,060 --> 01:10:46,060
They can't.

999
01:10:46,580 --> 01:10:47,660
It isn't true!

1000
01:10:52,860 --> 01:10:53,420
Hm?

1001
01:10:53,750 --> 01:10:55,280
What's the matter, Sensei?

1002
01:10:57,380 --> 01:10:58,380
Look, Naruto.

1003
01:10:59,060 --> 01:11:02,020
Don't you realize what you're doing by
pulling these pranks all the time?

1004
01:11:09,440 --> 01:11:10,700
There it is again!

1005
01:11:11,400 --> 01:11:12,860
I don't understand it!

1006
01:11:13,260 --> 01:11:13,820
Everybody!

1007
01:11:14,240 --> 01:11:15,240
Even you!

1008
01:11:15,280 --> 01:11:16,280
My own teacher!

1009
01:11:16,960 --> 01:11:19,640
Why does everybody look at me like that
all the time?

1010
01:11:21,340 --> 01:11:25,000
I'm not just a nuisance or some kind of
germ I'm a person too!

1011
01:11:25,540 --> 01:11:26,540
I am!

1012
01:11:27,520 --> 01:11:28,760
I'm Naruto Uzumaki!

1013
01:11:29,020 --> 01:11:30,020
Don't forget it!

1014
01:11:30,080 --> 01:11:31,080
No, wait!

1015
01:11:46,110 --> 01:11:47,680
Good morning, everyone.

1016
01:11:47,815 --> 01:11:49,220
Good morning, Sensei!

1017
01:11:50,240 --> 01:11:52,060
All right, first let me take attendance.

1018
01:11:54,400 --> 01:11:55,400
Naruto's not here?

1019
01:11:55,505 --> 01:11:56,505
Who cares?

1020
01:11:57,220 --> 01:11:58,300
He's such a loser.

1021
01:11:58,640 --> 01:11:59,640
Sakura!

1022
01:11:59,800 --> 01:12:01,020
You know where he is?

1023
01:12:01,580 --> 01:12:02,580
No.

1024
01:12:02,730 --> 01:12:04,140
I didn't notice he was gone.

1025
01:12:04,480 --> 01:12:06,620
Yeah, I don't think I even saw him this
morning.

1026
01:12:07,010 --> 01:12:08,200
Kiba, did you see him?

1027
01:12:09,020 --> 01:12:10,760
No, I didn't see him.

1028
01:12:11,005 --> 01:12:13,100
And I have no interest in seeing him.

1029
01:12:13,425 --> 01:12:14,425
Right, Akamaru?

1030
01:12:16,500 --> 01:12:17,500
All right, then.

1031
01:12:18,740 --> 01:12:20,060
Let's just start class.

1032
01:12:22,560 --> 01:12:23,560
But why not?

1033
01:12:24,400 --> 01:12:26,900
Lord Hokage is busy with his official
duties.

1034
01:12:27,160 --> 01:12:28,160
I don't understand.

1035
01:12:28,660 --> 01:12:30,380
Did he give a reason why he won't see me?

1036
01:12:30,580 --> 01:12:31,580
That's not our concern.

1037
01:12:31,700 --> 01:12:32,700
We have our orders.

1038
01:12:32,790 --> 01:12:34,200
No one is permitted to enter.

1039
01:12:41,560 --> 01:12:42,560
Hello there.

1040
01:12:44,170 --> 01:12:45,170
Huh?

1041
01:12:45,255 --> 01:12:47,530
You know, this is my favorite spot.

1042
01:12:48,000 --> 01:12:50,866
But I can't really
concentrate on my reading

1043
01:12:50,867 --> 01:12:53,971
with all that sighing
going on down there.

1044
01:12:54,120 --> 01:12:55,290
Oh, I'm so sorry.

1045
01:12:55,660 --> 01:12:56,660
I'll just go.

1046
01:12:57,025 --> 01:12:58,550
No, don't bother.

1047
01:12:59,800 --> 01:13:01,150
I was just about to leave.

1048
01:13:02,970 --> 01:13:03,970
See ya.

1049
01:13:09,600 --> 01:13:10,600
What's wrong?

1050
01:13:10,800 --> 01:13:11,800
You look depressed.

1051
01:13:12,420 --> 01:13:14,740
If you feel like talking, I'll listen.

1052
01:13:22,365 --> 01:13:23,365
Kakashi.

1053
01:13:24,400 --> 01:13:25,460
That's your name, right?

1054
01:13:27,490 --> 01:13:30,380
The thing is, I happen to be...

1055
01:13:31,080 --> 01:13:33,580
I'm Naruto Uzumaki's homeroom teacher.

1056
01:13:34,520 --> 01:13:35,520
Really?

1057
01:13:35,880 --> 01:13:39,160
I went to ask the third Hokage to relieve
me from my assignment.

1058
01:13:39,640 --> 01:13:40,780
But he wouldn't see me.

1059
01:13:42,820 --> 01:13:45,640
Truth is, I don't have any idea how to
deal with that boy.

1060
01:13:47,700 --> 01:13:48,700
Nothing works.

1061
01:13:49,220 --> 01:13:52,220
I don't know why the Hokage thought I was
the right person for this.

1062
01:13:53,040 --> 01:13:55,980
I'm just not qualified to teach a kid like
Naruto.

1063
01:13:58,240 --> 01:14:00,560
Perhaps you've forgotten a basic rule of
teaching.

1064
01:14:01,320 --> 01:14:04,960
You cannot open the mind of another unless
you have an open mind yourself.

1065
01:14:06,200 --> 01:14:08,580
Or perhaps there's something else you're
trying to forget.

1066
01:14:10,180 --> 01:14:15,200
The nine tail sealed inside of Naruto is
responsible for my parents' deaths.

1067
01:14:16,080 --> 01:14:19,640
I'm fully aware that Naruto is not to
blame for what occurred back then.

1068
01:14:21,360 --> 01:14:23,406
But whenever I look
at him, I can't stop

1069
01:14:23,407 --> 01:14:25,780
thinking about what's
hiding deep inside of him.

1070
01:14:26,340 --> 01:14:27,880
And about what the nine tails did.

1071
01:14:29,200 --> 01:14:32,060
I don't think someone like me can make
Naruto open up.

1072
01:14:33,500 --> 01:14:36,660
Actually, you are the only one who can
reach Naruto's heart.

1073
01:14:38,860 --> 01:14:42,140
And that... That is
your personal ordeal.

1074
01:14:43,240 --> 01:14:44,240
My ordeal?

1075
01:14:44,540 --> 01:14:47,880
Yes, Lord Hokage has presented you with a
personal ordeal.

1076
01:14:47,881 --> 01:14:50,384
I believe if you can
just hang in there a little

1077
01:14:50,385 --> 01:14:53,221
longer, you will find
the way to reach Naruto.

1078
01:14:53,740 --> 01:14:56,080
Rise up to meet the Hokage's expectations.

1079
01:14:57,480 --> 01:14:58,480
So long.

1080
01:15:10,820 --> 01:15:13,800
The third Hokage sure made a bold
decision.

1081
01:15:25,260 --> 01:15:26,860
Time to go!

1082
01:15:27,020 --> 01:15:27,520
Taichi!

1083
01:15:27,820 --> 01:15:28,820
Dinner time!

1084
01:15:29,860 --> 01:15:31,380
Let's go home, everyone!

1085
01:15:31,695 --> 01:15:32,695
Mom!

1086
01:15:35,350 --> 01:15:36,590
What do you think you're doing?

1087
01:15:36,795 --> 01:15:38,630
I told you not to play with that boy.

1088
01:15:38,805 --> 01:15:40,570
Come on, let's go.

1089
01:15:46,150 --> 01:15:46,630
Shikamaru!

1090
01:15:46,910 --> 01:15:47,910
Come on, let's go!

1091
01:15:47,990 --> 01:15:49,230
All right, Dad.

1092
01:15:51,590 --> 01:15:52,830
You too, Choji.

1093
01:15:53,050 --> 01:15:54,150
We said we'd walk you home.

1094
01:15:54,290 --> 01:15:55,210
Now let's go, you two.

1095
01:15:55,290 --> 01:15:56,290
Let's move!

1096
01:15:56,550 --> 01:15:57,550
See you, Naruto!

1097
01:15:58,330 --> 01:15:58,810
Later.

1098
01:15:59,350 --> 01:15:59,590
Yeah.

1099
01:16:00,030 --> 01:16:01,030
Bye.

1100
01:16:08,740 --> 01:16:10,660
Dad, let go of my hand.

1101
01:16:11,880 --> 01:16:12,100
What?

1102
01:16:12,440 --> 01:16:14,760
Are you embarrassed to be seen with your
old man?

1103
01:17:19,510 --> 01:17:21,380
Thank you.

1104
01:17:30,010 --> 01:17:31,280
Thank you for the food.

1105
01:18:02,240 --> 01:18:03,240
No, let me

1106
01:18:34,160 --> 01:18:35,160
go!

1107
01:18:44,280 --> 01:18:45,940
Who's that at my door?

1108
01:18:46,620 --> 01:18:48,140
And why are they here so early?

1109
01:19:01,870 --> 01:19:02,870
What?

1110
01:19:02,930 --> 01:19:04,110
Iruka Sensei?

1111
01:19:04,660 --> 01:19:06,730
Why is he coming to see me here?

1112
01:19:28,560 --> 01:19:29,560
Hey, Naruto!

1113
01:19:34,110 --> 01:19:35,110
Naruto!

1114
01:19:35,830 --> 01:19:36,830
You here?

1115
01:19:44,490 --> 01:19:45,950
Is this all he ever eats?

1116
01:19:50,840 --> 01:19:51,840
Thanks for the food.

1117
01:19:52,565 --> 01:19:54,205
You're going to Choji's later,
aren't you?

1118
01:19:54,580 --> 01:19:55,080
Better hurry.

1119
01:19:55,585 --> 01:19:56,585
Yeah, yeah.

1120
01:19:57,530 --> 01:20:00,440
Hey, Dad, can I ask you about something
that's been bugging me?

1121
01:20:00,760 --> 01:20:01,760
What is it?

1122
01:20:02,120 --> 01:20:03,140
It's about Naruto.

1123
01:20:03,570 --> 01:20:05,740
Why does everybody avoid him like the
plague?

1124
01:20:07,900 --> 01:20:09,280
Did he do something wrong?

1125
01:20:11,795 --> 01:20:15,120
Shikamaru, why don't you tell me how you
feel about Naruto?

1126
01:20:17,070 --> 01:20:18,660
You want to know how I feel?

1127
01:20:19,365 --> 01:20:21,240
Huh, I never thought about it before.

1128
01:20:23,090 --> 01:20:26,220
Well, he's not the sharpest knife in the
drawer, but he's pretty funny.

1129
01:20:26,620 --> 01:20:28,239
I don't think we'll
ever be buddies or

1130
01:20:28,240 --> 01:20:30,560
anything, but it's not
like I want to avoid him.

1131
01:20:30,860 --> 01:20:33,940
Well, then, ignore the others.

1132
01:20:34,300 --> 01:20:36,220
I say treat him however you want to.

1133
01:20:36,910 --> 01:20:39,460
Yeah, that's exactly what I'll do.

1134
01:20:52,020 --> 01:20:52,240
Ha!

1135
01:20:52,600 --> 01:20:54,440
I knew I'd find you here.

1136
01:20:55,420 --> 01:20:57,980
Hey, Shigamaru, can you lend me some
money?

1137
01:20:58,900 --> 01:21:00,520
Wait, let me guess why.

1138
01:21:00,660 --> 01:21:01,740
For some snacks again?

1139
01:21:02,220 --> 01:21:02,740
Yeah!

1140
01:21:03,100 --> 01:21:05,940
I mean, what else is there to buy besides
snacks?

1141
01:21:06,180 --> 01:21:08,420
And even if there was, why would you want
it?

1142
01:21:08,470 --> 01:21:10,420
Oh man, what a drag.

1143
01:21:11,835 --> 01:21:14,080
You know, you're one in a million.

1144
01:21:26,325 --> 01:21:27,325
What's with your eyes?

1145
01:21:27,595 --> 01:21:28,670
They're so creepy!

1146
01:21:28,925 --> 01:21:31,670
Yeah, don't even look at us, you weirdo!

1147
01:21:32,155 --> 01:21:33,630
Come on, cut it out!

1148
01:21:33,885 --> 01:21:34,885
Leave her alone!

1149
01:21:35,375 --> 01:21:36,810
What'd she do to you anyway?

1150
01:21:37,275 --> 01:21:39,690
What, you want to be a big hero or
something?

1151
01:21:42,420 --> 01:21:44,830
You shouldn't pick on people weaker than
you, you know?

1152
01:21:44,930 --> 01:21:45,590
What?

1153
01:21:45,905 --> 01:21:47,210
Just shut up, kid!

1154
01:21:51,140 --> 01:21:53,230
Whatever, this is boring.

1155
01:21:53,405 --> 01:21:54,405
Let's go, guys.

1156
01:21:55,015 --> 01:21:56,530
Yeah, this is boring.

1157
01:21:56,775 --> 01:21:57,775
Let's go!

1158
01:21:59,975 --> 01:22:01,410
Man, what a drag.

1159
01:22:01,639 --> 01:22:03,690
I can't believe him doing stuff like that.

1160
01:22:04,230 --> 01:22:08,751
Instead of butting into other people's
business, he should be polishing his skills.

1161
01:22:08,850 --> 01:22:10,110
Stupid Naruto.

1162
01:22:13,215 --> 01:22:14,410
Don't call him that.

1163
01:22:14,830 --> 01:22:15,270
Huh?

1164
01:22:15,710 --> 01:22:16,710
What?

1165
01:22:17,375 --> 01:22:19,070
Naruto isn't stupid.

1166
01:22:20,170 --> 01:22:25,579
I mean, even you said that in shogi all the
pieces are necessary, and you said that.

1167
01:22:25,580 --> 01:22:26,110
..

1168
01:22:26,111 --> 01:22:27,111
about me.

1169
01:22:27,210 --> 01:22:28,210
Huh?

1170
01:22:28,750 --> 01:22:30,250
What are you talking about, Choji?

1171
01:22:31,210 --> 01:22:34,950
You're just mad at me because I didn't
loan you any money before, that's all.

1172
01:22:38,265 --> 01:22:39,265
You're wrong.

1173
01:22:40,800 --> 01:22:41,920
Naruto is...

1174
01:22:42,145 --> 01:22:43,920
Naruto's like you, Shikamaru.

1175
01:22:44,395 --> 01:22:45,660
Don't call him stupid.

1176
01:22:45,905 --> 01:22:47,040
Now take it back.

1177
01:22:48,080 --> 01:22:49,900
Man, what a drag.

1178
01:22:50,395 --> 01:22:53,320
Listen, at least try and make sense when
you talk.

1179
01:22:56,800 --> 01:22:59,100
Don't... Don't you
order me around.

1180
01:23:01,120 --> 01:23:02,120
Hey!

1181
01:23:02,160 --> 01:23:02,420
Hey!

1182
01:23:02,880 --> 01:23:03,880
What are you guys doing?

1183
01:23:04,240 --> 01:23:05,300
Come on, stop it!

1184
01:23:05,560 --> 01:23:06,920
You guys are friends, aren't you?

1185
01:23:06,921 --> 01:23:08,020
Why are you fighting?

1186
01:23:08,340 --> 01:23:08,500
Hey!

1187
01:23:09,000 --> 01:23:10,000
Stop!

1188
01:23:10,560 --> 01:23:14,210
Cause... this fatso started complaining.

1189
01:23:15,800 --> 01:23:17,720
Shikamaru, open your eyes!

1190
01:23:18,680 --> 01:23:20,400
I'm not a fatso!

1191
01:23:23,000 --> 01:23:25,100
I'm pleasantly plump.

1192
01:23:27,140 --> 01:23:28,140
All right.

1193
01:23:29,230 --> 01:23:30,820
Let me buy into this fight.

1194
01:23:31,940 --> 01:23:32,940
Huh?

1195
01:23:33,930 --> 01:23:34,960
What's that mean?

1196
01:23:36,510 --> 01:23:40,480
Oh, then I'm gonna buy snacks with all the
money you'll pay me.

1197
01:23:40,640 --> 01:23:41,640
What?

1198
01:23:42,810 --> 01:23:43,840
What's that about?

1199
01:23:49,480 --> 01:23:50,480
Yeah,

1200
01:23:56,480 --> 01:23:57,660
that's exactly what I did.

1201
01:23:58,030 --> 01:23:59,480
And then I went to the usual spot.

1202
01:23:59,600 --> 01:24:01,020
You guys know the place, right?

1203
01:24:02,470 --> 01:24:04,160
So that's what happened.

1204
01:24:04,740 --> 01:24:06,440
Naruto, you want some chips?

1205
01:24:06,790 --> 01:24:08,520
Oh, yeah, thanks.

1206
01:24:15,430 --> 01:24:17,220
Hey, look!

1207
01:24:18,220 --> 01:24:19,220
What?

1208
01:24:42,779 --> 01:24:43,779
Seriously?

1209
01:24:44,005 --> 01:24:45,060
What a drag.

1210
01:24:45,320 --> 01:24:46,340
Man, forget that.

1211
01:24:46,445 --> 01:24:47,660
No girls for me.

1212
01:24:53,180 --> 01:24:55,280
Look out, she's coming!

1213
01:25:02,040 --> 01:25:03,360
Look out!

1214
01:25:05,780 --> 01:25:13,800
Oh, man.

1215
01:25:15,880 --> 01:25:19,160
That Ina, she's terrified when she's mad.

1216
01:25:19,600 --> 01:25:20,600
What a drag.

1217
01:25:21,540 --> 01:25:23,960
I swear she's gonna end up in a hole of
pain.

1218
01:25:27,620 --> 01:25:28,740
See you later, Naruto.

1219
01:25:29,155 --> 01:25:31,480
Your sexy jutsu was awesome.

1220
01:25:31,795 --> 01:25:33,040
Bye-bye, Naruto.

1221
01:25:35,270 --> 01:25:38,240
Hey, Shigemaru, it's curry night at my
house tonight.

1222
01:25:39,345 --> 01:25:40,560
That sounds great.

1223
01:25:40,965 --> 01:25:42,660
I'm getting tired of my mom's cooking.

1224
01:25:46,850 --> 01:25:48,080
Kay, see ya!

1225
01:25:48,640 --> 01:25:49,960
See you tomorrow!

1226
01:25:54,200 --> 01:25:55,320
Come here!

1227
01:26:02,980 --> 01:26:04,840
Naruto, come back here!

1228
01:26:05,060 --> 01:26:06,380
You're gonna get my hands on you?

1229
01:26:06,660 --> 01:26:08,720
You crossed the line this time,
Naruto!

1230
01:26:14,790 --> 01:26:15,790
Give it up!

1231
01:26:16,870 --> 01:26:19,770
You're just bent because you don't have
the guts to do what I do.

1232
01:26:20,090 --> 01:26:22,230
Do ya, losers, wannabes?

1233
01:26:22,370 --> 01:26:24,010
You'll never catch me!

1234
01:26:25,190 --> 01:26:27,530
Lord Hokage, it's an emergency!

1235
01:26:28,110 --> 01:26:30,930
I hope you're not bothering me with some
trivia.

1236
01:26:31,130 --> 01:26:33,150
And don't tell me it's Naruto again.

1237
01:26:33,350 --> 01:26:34,650
It is Naruto again!

1238
01:26:34,870 --> 01:26:36,450
He climbed onto the great stone faces!

1239
01:26:36,610 --> 01:26:38,530
He put graffiti all over the Hokage!

1240
01:26:49,090 --> 01:26:50,090
Naruto!

1241
01:26:50,150 --> 01:26:51,150
Hold on!

1242
01:26:54,890 --> 01:26:56,930
That was too easy!

1243
01:26:57,530 --> 01:26:58,750
Oh yeah, Naruto!

1244
01:27:03,430 --> 01:27:05,430
Where'd you come from, Iruka-sensei?

1245
01:27:05,550 --> 01:27:06,690
What are you doing here?

1246
01:27:06,970 --> 01:27:08,290
No, what are you doing here?

1247
01:27:08,350 --> 01:27:09,610
You're supposed to be in class.

1248
01:27:11,265 --> 01:27:13,830
We will now start the final exam.

1249
01:27:14,455 --> 01:27:16,850
When your name is called, proceed to the
testing room.

1250
01:27:17,435 --> 01:27:20,791
The final test will be
on... The clone jutsu.

1251
01:27:22,090 --> 01:27:23,750
That's my worst technique!

1252
01:27:24,410 --> 01:27:24,610
Great!

1253
01:27:25,110 --> 01:27:26,690
I'm never gonna pass!

1254
01:27:30,830 --> 01:27:33,230
Alright, get it together, Naruto!

1255
01:27:33,750 --> 01:27:34,790
You can do this!

1256
01:27:35,150 --> 01:27:36,150
Believe it!

1257
01:27:38,950 --> 01:27:40,410
Clone jutsu!

1258
01:27:49,280 --> 01:27:50,760
You failed!

1259
01:27:53,875 --> 01:27:55,480
Iruka-sensei.

1260
01:27:55,900 --> 01:27:59,380
He's off, but his moves weren't bad,
and he did hang in there and replicate.

1261
01:28:00,085 --> 01:28:03,320
This is his third try, so you know he
really wants to become a ninja.

1262
01:28:03,465 --> 01:28:05,780
We could cut him a break and pass him.

1263
01:28:06,170 --> 01:28:07,700
Mizuki-sensei.

1264
01:28:07,825 --> 01:28:11,220
The other students created at least three
effective replications.

1265
01:28:12,850 --> 01:28:15,020
But Naruto could only create one.

1266
01:28:15,505 --> 01:28:16,505
And look at it.

1267
01:28:16,760 --> 01:28:17,760
It's pitiful.

1268
01:28:18,365 --> 01:28:19,640
I can't pass him.

1269
01:28:20,600 --> 01:28:21,340
See that?

1270
01:28:21,520 --> 01:28:23,100
They called me first!

1271
01:28:27,740 --> 01:28:29,140
I'm proud of you, son.

1272
01:28:29,440 --> 01:28:30,440
We all are.

1273
01:28:31,549 --> 01:28:32,549
There.

1274
01:28:36,260 --> 01:28:37,260
You see him?

1275
01:28:37,840 --> 01:28:38,860
It's that boy.

1276
01:28:39,360 --> 01:28:41,120
I heard he's the only one who failed.

1277
01:28:42,620 --> 01:28:43,740
Well, it serves him right.

1278
01:28:44,380 --> 01:28:47,100
Just imagine what would happen if he
became a ninja.

1279
01:28:47,620 --> 01:28:49,480
I mean, he's the boy who... Shh!

1280
01:28:49,660 --> 01:28:51,720
We're not allowed to talk about that.

1281
01:28:55,080 --> 01:28:56,080
Iruka.

1282
01:28:57,615 --> 01:29:00,120
There's something we need to talk about.

1283
01:29:06,280 --> 01:29:08,890
Iruka-sensei's tough, but he's not against
you.

1284
01:29:09,250 --> 01:29:10,250
Then why?

1285
01:29:10,465 --> 01:29:11,465
Why only me?

1286
01:29:13,570 --> 01:29:16,070
He wants you to be strong with all his
heart.

1287
01:29:16,550 --> 01:29:19,370
But that will never happen if he goes easy
on you.

1288
01:29:20,045 --> 01:29:21,170
He's like you, you know.

1289
01:29:21,430 --> 01:29:22,990
No parents, no family.

1290
01:29:24,990 --> 01:29:27,250
But... this time I really wanted to
graduate.

1291
01:29:29,750 --> 01:29:31,650
Then I guess I have to tell you.

1292
01:29:31,890 --> 01:29:32,890
Huh?

1293
01:29:33,890 --> 01:29:37,190
It's a secret, but I'm gonna let you in on
it.

1294
01:29:38,410 --> 01:29:39,670
A secret?

1295
01:29:43,335 --> 01:29:44,335
Iruka.

1296
01:29:45,675 --> 01:29:47,730
What is it, Lord Hokage?

1297
01:29:48,550 --> 01:29:50,030
I know how you feel.

1298
01:29:50,595 --> 01:29:52,490
You grew up just like Naruto.

1299
01:29:53,250 --> 01:29:55,930
Without knowing the love of a mother and
father.

1300
01:29:56,590 --> 01:29:58,110
The warmth of a family.

1301
01:30:00,610 --> 01:30:01,870
It's getting closer!

1302
01:30:01,930 --> 01:30:03,450
Don't let it near the village!

1303
01:30:03,810 --> 01:30:04,530
Let me go!

1304
01:30:04,830 --> 01:30:07,130
My mom and dad are still fighting back
there!

1305
01:30:11,110 --> 01:30:12,810
Iruka-sensei, wake up!

1306
01:30:15,290 --> 01:30:15,870
What?

1307
01:30:16,055 --> 01:30:17,055
What is it?

1308
01:30:17,260 --> 01:30:19,770
You need to come to Lord Hokage's right
away.

1309
01:30:20,295 --> 01:30:21,295
It's Naruto.

1310
01:30:22,310 --> 01:30:23,950
He stole the sacred scroll.

1311
01:30:24,690 --> 01:30:26,130
You mean the scroll of ceiling?

1312
01:30:26,290 --> 01:30:27,290
No!

1313
01:30:28,890 --> 01:30:29,890
Let's see.

1314
01:30:30,235 --> 01:30:34,490
The first one is...
Multi-Shadow Clone Jutsu.

1315
01:30:36,010 --> 01:30:37,430
Not this again!

1316
01:30:37,510 --> 01:30:38,910
It's my worst Jutsu!

1317
01:30:39,550 --> 01:30:41,810
Lord Hokage, this is not just a prank!

1318
01:30:42,050 --> 01:30:43,270
This is a serious crime!

1319
01:30:43,350 --> 01:30:46,890
That scroll contained secrets that were
sealed by the first Hokage.

1320
01:30:47,130 --> 01:30:49,110
Secrets known only to our village!

1321
01:30:49,350 --> 01:30:52,610
If it falls into the wrong hands,
they can destroy our entire way of life.

1322
01:30:54,490 --> 01:30:55,490
All right.

1323
01:30:55,870 --> 01:30:58,470
Bring Naruto here at once, sir!

1324
01:31:09,040 --> 01:31:10,300
Where would he go?

1325
01:31:19,140 --> 01:31:22,900
Now that I told everyone what Naruto did,
I can eliminate him.

1326
01:31:23,120 --> 01:31:24,260
I'm glad he's gone.

1327
01:31:24,640 --> 01:31:27,380
And of course, I keep the scroll for
myself.

1328
01:31:32,230 --> 01:31:33,550
It's all over.

1329
01:31:39,490 --> 01:31:40,490
Huh?

1330
01:31:40,695 --> 01:31:41,695
Got me already.

1331
01:31:41,890 --> 01:31:42,410
Not bad.

1332
01:31:42,750 --> 01:31:43,770
You're quick, Sensei.

1333
01:31:43,955 --> 01:31:45,690
I only had time to learn one technique.

1334
01:31:46,735 --> 01:31:47,990
He's been out here practicing.

1335
01:31:48,660 --> 01:31:50,180
I can tell how hard he's been working.

1336
01:31:51,019 --> 01:31:52,019
Listen, Aruka Sensei.

1337
01:31:52,430 --> 01:31:55,286
I'm going to show you this amazing Jutsu
and you're going to let me graduate.

1338
01:31:55,310 --> 01:31:56,470
Then everything will be okay.

1339
01:31:56,875 --> 01:31:58,026
That's the way it works, right?

1340
01:31:58,050 --> 01:32:00,370
Anyone who learns a Jutsu from this scroll
passes.

1341
01:32:00,770 --> 01:32:01,170
Huh?

1342
01:32:01,470 --> 01:32:02,590
Where'd you get that idea?

1343
01:32:03,110 --> 01:32:04,590
Mizuki Sensei told me about it.

1344
01:32:04,710 --> 01:32:05,370
Believe it!

1345
01:32:05,470 --> 01:32:08,550
He told me where to find the scroll and
this place.

1346
01:32:11,170 --> 01:32:11,470
Huh?

1347
01:32:12,110 --> 01:32:13,110
Mizuki?

1348
01:32:13,350 --> 01:32:13,550
Huh?

1349
01:32:14,170 --> 01:32:15,170
Look out!

1350
01:32:18,030 --> 01:32:20,330
I see you found our little hideaway.

1351
01:32:21,150 --> 01:32:22,630
So that's the way it is, huh?

1352
01:32:22,710 --> 01:32:23,710
I should have known.

1353
01:32:27,510 --> 01:32:28,110
Naruto!

1354
01:32:28,111 --> 01:32:29,870
Give me the scroll now!

1355
01:32:30,670 --> 01:32:31,670
Wait a minute!

1356
01:32:32,450 --> 01:32:33,870
What's going on here?

1357
01:32:36,270 --> 01:32:36,790
Naruto!

1358
01:32:37,210 --> 01:32:38,810
Don't let Mizuki get the scroll!

1359
01:32:39,390 --> 01:32:42,430
He contains forbidden Jutsu that could put
this village in grave danger.

1360
01:32:42,690 --> 01:32:46,630
Mizuki used you to get the scroll for
himself, for his own power!

1361
01:32:50,690 --> 01:32:51,210
Naruto...

1362
01:32:51,211 --> 01:32:54,670
Iruka's just trying to scare you because
he doesn't want you to have the scroll.

1363
01:32:57,630 --> 01:32:59,330
Stop lying, Mizuki!

1364
01:32:59,830 --> 01:33:01,430
Don't let him trick you, Naruto!

1365
01:33:02,490 --> 01:33:04,970
Oh, I'll tell you who's really lying.

1366
01:33:05,370 --> 01:33:06,370
No, Mizuki!

1367
01:33:06,670 --> 01:33:09,550
They've been lying to you your whole life,
Naruto.

1368
01:33:10,290 --> 01:33:12,230
Since the decree twelve years ago.

1369
01:33:12,890 --> 01:33:13,890
What decree?

1370
01:33:14,270 --> 01:33:15,830
Everyone knows except you.

1371
01:33:16,450 --> 01:33:18,270
Iruka's trying to hide it from you even
now.

1372
01:33:18,410 --> 01:33:20,190
He'd do anything to shut me up.

1373
01:33:20,650 --> 01:33:21,670
What is this decree?

1374
01:33:22,370 --> 01:33:24,170
Why does everyone else know about it?

1375
01:33:24,590 --> 01:33:25,410
Don't tell him!

1376
01:33:25,411 --> 01:33:26,411
It's forbidden!

1377
01:33:26,530 --> 01:33:30,570
The decree is no one can tell you the
nine-tailed fox is inside you.

1378
01:33:32,250 --> 01:33:34,820
The fox spirit that
killed Iruka's parents and

1379
01:33:34,821 --> 01:33:37,770
destroyed our village
has taken over your body.

1380
01:33:37,930 --> 01:33:39,990
You are the nine-tailed fox.

1381
01:33:40,190 --> 01:33:41,350
Stop it!

1382
01:33:41,590 --> 01:33:45,210
They've all been sneaking around,
hiding things from you your whole life.

1383
01:33:45,790 --> 01:33:47,990
Didn't you think it was strange how they
treated you?

1384
01:33:48,310 --> 01:33:49,310
Like dirt.

1385
01:33:49,410 --> 01:33:51,610
Like they hated you for just being alive.

1386
01:33:52,230 --> 01:33:53,230
No!

1387
01:33:53,630 --> 01:33:55,730
No, no, no, no!

1388
01:33:57,870 --> 01:34:01,690
Naruto... That's why you will
never be accepted in this village.

1389
01:34:01,830 --> 01:34:04,530
Even your beloved Sensei hates your guts.

1390
01:34:05,170 --> 01:34:06,170
Die, Naruto!

1391
01:34:09,210 --> 01:34:10,870
Naruto, get down!

1392
01:34:18,710 --> 01:34:19,710
Why?

1393
01:34:24,210 --> 01:34:25,670
Because we're the same.

1394
01:34:26,585 --> 01:34:29,790
When I lost my parents, no one seemed to
care.

1395
01:34:30,110 --> 01:34:31,950
They didn't have time for me.

1396
01:34:32,670 --> 01:34:34,330
They just forgot I was there.

1397
01:34:35,250 --> 01:34:36,250
My grades dropped.

1398
01:34:36,930 --> 01:34:38,470
I became the class clown.

1399
01:34:39,470 --> 01:34:42,770
I just wanted them to see me and to know
my name.

1400
01:34:43,730 --> 01:34:46,830
My schoolwork wasn't good enough to get
their attention.

1401
01:34:47,310 --> 01:34:49,310
So I did crazy things.

1402
01:34:50,070 --> 01:34:52,130
And then I had to pay for it.

1403
01:34:52,690 --> 01:34:53,770
It was hard.

1404
01:34:55,430 --> 01:34:57,410
I know that's how you feel, Naruto.

1405
01:34:57,411 --> 01:35:01,610
You feel lonely and it hurts inside.

1406
01:35:02,470 --> 01:35:04,430
And I could have been there for you more.

1407
01:35:05,230 --> 01:35:06,990
But I let you down.

1408
01:35:07,550 --> 01:35:08,550
I'm sorry.

1409
01:35:08,970 --> 01:35:10,690
No one should have to suffer that much.

1410
01:35:11,410 --> 01:35:13,390
No one should be alone like that.

1411
01:35:19,370 --> 01:35:20,370
Naruto!

1412
01:35:22,090 --> 01:35:22,650
Naruto!

1413
01:35:22,651 --> 01:35:23,651
Naruto!

1414
01:35:25,750 --> 01:35:30,010
You know, once he makes up his mind,
nothing can change it.

1415
01:35:30,430 --> 01:35:33,570
He's going to use the scroll to take
revenge on the village.

1416
01:35:35,019 --> 01:35:37,310
You saw that look in his eye, didn't you?

1417
01:35:37,769 --> 01:35:39,330
Those are the eyes of a beast.

1418
01:35:41,590 --> 01:35:42,590
No.

1419
01:35:44,750 --> 01:35:46,870
Naruto isn't like that.

1420
01:35:50,150 --> 01:35:51,150
You're a joke.

1421
01:35:52,650 --> 01:35:54,330
I'm going to get Naruto and get the
scroll.

1422
01:35:54,890 --> 01:35:56,150
I'll be back for you.

1423
01:35:59,370 --> 01:35:59,670
Naruto!

1424
01:36:00,390 --> 01:36:02,450
Everything Mizuki said was a lie!

1425
01:36:03,290 --> 01:36:04,010
Give me the scroll!

1426
01:36:04,310 --> 01:36:05,310
Hurry!

1427
01:36:05,570 --> 01:36:07,490
He's coming after you to take it away!

1428
01:36:12,970 --> 01:36:17,450
It can't be.

1429
01:36:28,020 --> 01:36:30,800
How did you know, Naruto?

1430
01:36:32,520 --> 01:36:37,120
How did you know that it was me and not
Iruka?

1431
01:36:41,640 --> 01:36:43,020
Because I... Iruka.

1432
01:36:45,080 --> 01:36:46,160
You're a fool.

1433
01:36:47,280 --> 01:36:48,820
Why are you protecting that freak?

1434
01:36:49,400 --> 01:36:51,360
He's the one that wiped out your family.

1435
01:36:51,960 --> 01:36:53,580
I don't care what you say.

1436
01:36:53,720 --> 01:36:55,860
You're not getting your hands on that
scroll.

1437
01:36:56,440 --> 01:36:57,920
As if you could stop me.

1438
01:36:58,420 --> 01:36:59,180
Don't you get it?

1439
01:36:59,220 --> 01:37:00,660
Naruto is just like me.

1440
01:37:01,920 --> 01:37:02,920
How's that?

1441
01:37:03,260 --> 01:37:06,420
He wants the scroll for his own power and
his own vengeance.

1442
01:37:07,140 --> 01:37:08,180
That's how beasts are.

1443
01:37:09,000 --> 01:37:12,280
He'll pour all his rage into the scroll
and destroy everything.

1444
01:37:13,640 --> 01:37:14,640
You're right.

1445
01:37:17,810 --> 01:37:18,810
So it's true.

1446
01:37:19,925 --> 01:37:21,760
Iruka-sensei never believed in me.

1447
01:37:22,325 --> 01:37:23,960
He thinks I'm some beast.

1448
01:37:24,769 --> 01:37:25,980
Some kind of freak!

1449
01:37:26,980 --> 01:37:28,660
That is how beasts are.

1450
01:37:30,460 --> 01:37:32,960
But that's not who Naruto is.

1451
01:37:33,460 --> 01:37:34,600
He's nothing like that.

1452
01:37:35,200 --> 01:37:36,360
Naruto's one of a kind.

1453
01:37:36,740 --> 01:37:38,780
Works hard, puts his whole heart into it.

1454
01:37:39,140 --> 01:37:42,040
Sure, he messes up sometimes and everyone
jumps on him.

1455
01:37:42,620 --> 01:37:44,640
But his suffering only makes him stronger.

1456
01:37:45,240 --> 01:37:47,420
That's what separates him from being a
beast.

1457
01:37:48,380 --> 01:37:49,120
So you're wrong.

1458
01:37:49,240 --> 01:37:51,100
He's nothing like the nine-tailed fox.

1459
01:37:51,860 --> 01:37:53,560
He's Naruto Uzumaki.

1460
01:37:54,140 --> 01:37:56,260
Of the village hidden in the leaves.

1461
01:38:01,180 --> 01:38:03,720
You really believe that drivel?

1462
01:38:04,160 --> 01:38:07,940
Iruka, I was going to save you for later,
but I changed my mind.

1463
01:38:08,180 --> 01:38:09,180
You're finished!

1464
01:38:18,560 --> 01:38:19,560
Naruto!

1465
01:38:21,940 --> 01:38:24,360
Not bad for a little punk.

1466
01:38:25,440 --> 01:38:27,960
If you ever lay a hand on my sensei...

1467
01:38:28,700 --> 01:38:29,920
I'll kill you!

1468
01:38:30,500 --> 01:38:31,500
Such big words.

1469
01:38:31,920 --> 01:38:34,900
I can completely destroy you with a single
move!

1470
01:38:35,640 --> 01:38:37,140
Take your best shot, fool!

1471
01:38:37,520 --> 01:38:39,720
I'll give it back to you a thousand-fold!

1472
01:38:40,460 --> 01:38:41,460
Let's see you try!

1473
01:38:41,860 --> 01:38:43,980
Show me what you can do, nine-tailed fox!

1474
01:38:44,840 --> 01:38:46,120
Shadow clone jutsu!

1475
01:38:56,860 --> 01:38:57,860
Namuto...

1476
01:38:58,660 --> 01:39:00,000
Those aren't just illusions.

1477
01:39:00,460 --> 01:39:01,460
They're solid clones.

1478
01:39:02,020 --> 01:39:04,540
He's mastered an extremely advanced jutsu.

1479
01:39:06,460 --> 01:39:08,240
What is this?

1480
01:39:13,500 --> 01:39:16,840
If you're not coming, then we're going to
come after you.

1481
01:39:32,630 --> 01:39:34,780
Sorry, I kind of got carried away.

1482
01:39:35,240 --> 01:39:37,160
You okay, Iruka-sensei?

1483
01:39:39,580 --> 01:39:40,580
Yeah...

1484
01:39:41,420 --> 01:39:43,580
Naruto, come here a minute.

1485
01:39:44,250 --> 01:39:46,240
I've got something I want to give you.

1486
01:39:49,120 --> 01:39:51,340
You're telling me no one can find Naruto?

1487
01:39:51,940 --> 01:39:52,680
Not a clue.

1488
01:39:52,825 --> 01:39:53,840
This is bad news.

1489
01:39:53,880 --> 01:39:55,500
We've got to smoke him out or something.

1490
01:39:56,400 --> 01:39:58,560
There's no longer any need to worry.

1491
01:39:59,335 --> 01:40:00,440
Lord Hokage!

1492
01:40:02,200 --> 01:40:03,340
The scroll's safe.

1493
01:40:03,600 --> 01:40:04,840
Naruto will be back soon.

1494
01:40:06,094 --> 01:40:08,020
Sensei, how much longer?

1495
01:40:08,645 --> 01:40:11,480
Okay, you can open your eyes now.

1496
01:40:22,295 --> 01:40:23,295
Congratulations.

1497
01:40:24,140 --> 01:40:25,140
You graduate.

1498
01:40:29,800 --> 01:40:32,030
And to celebrate, I have a surprise.

1499
01:40:32,670 --> 01:40:34,510
We're going out for ramen tonight.

1500
01:40:41,730 --> 01:40:42,850
Iruka-sensei!

1501
01:40:42,851 --> 01:40:43,851
That hurts!

1502
01:40:45,410 --> 01:40:48,070
Naruto, this is only the beginning.

1503
01:40:48,930 --> 01:40:51,010
The road gets tougher now that you're a
ninja.

1504
01:40:51,830 --> 01:40:54,730
But if I told you that, I guess it would
ruin the moment.

1505
01:40:55,610 --> 01:40:56,770
So I'll tell you later.

1506
01:40:57,490 --> 01:40:58,490
Over ramen.

1507
01:41:06,630 --> 01:41:07,720
It was coincidence.

1508
01:41:08,195 --> 01:41:11,940
But even so, it appears that Naruto has
saved the entire village.

1509
01:41:11,941 --> 01:41:13,660
You may leave now.

1510
01:41:14,380 --> 01:41:15,380
Yes, sir.

1511
01:41:19,520 --> 01:41:20,520
What is it?

1512
01:41:20,835 --> 01:41:22,770
Lord Hokage, I just...

1513
01:41:24,200 --> 01:41:28,030
I just wanted to thank you for placing me
in charge of Naruto, sir.

1514
01:41:29,365 --> 01:41:31,150
It's because of that assignment.

1515
01:41:31,570 --> 01:41:33,510
I remembered why I wanted to do this.

1516
01:41:33,850 --> 01:41:35,130
Why I wanted to be a teacher.

1517
01:41:36,145 --> 01:41:38,850
It all started with something you told me,
Lord Hokage.

1518
01:41:39,200 --> 01:41:40,630
A long, long time ago.

1519
01:41:47,450 --> 01:41:50,190
It's hard to believe it's been a year
already.

1520
01:41:50,895 --> 01:41:52,190
You're very brave.

1521
01:41:52,470 --> 01:41:55,410
It's hard to do that, to hide sadness
behind laughter.

1522
01:41:59,090 --> 01:42:03,090
Your instructors have been telling me that
you're among the most playful of all their

1523
01:42:03,091 --> 01:42:05,370
students and that you're always so full of
fun.

1524
01:42:09,770 --> 01:42:10,770
You're wrong!

1525
01:42:11,210 --> 01:42:12,810
I'm not sad about anything!

1526
01:42:13,290 --> 01:42:16,270
It's a noble thing to die in the line of
duty, isn't it?

1527
01:42:18,570 --> 01:42:23,030
My parents both gave their lives to
protect this place from the fox demon.

1528
01:42:23,550 --> 01:42:24,550
They're heroes!

1529
01:42:24,870 --> 01:42:26,630
I'm the son of those revered heroes.

1530
01:42:27,330 --> 01:42:30,070
I'm not even sad because they went and
left me all alone.

1531
01:42:30,470 --> 01:42:31,770
If I cry it's because I'm proud.

1532
01:42:31,771 --> 01:42:32,950
It's alright, Hiruka.

1533
01:42:33,990 --> 01:42:38,950
I know that somewhere inside of you
there's a boy curled up in a ball of pain.

1534
01:42:40,950 --> 01:42:42,110
But remember this.

1535
01:42:42,430 --> 01:42:43,670
You are not alone.

1536
01:42:45,310 --> 01:42:49,890
Inside every ninja of the hidden leaf
there burns the will of fire.

1537
01:42:52,190 --> 01:42:53,610
The will of fire?

1538
01:42:54,375 --> 01:42:57,510
It's what gives us the strength to defend
our village.

1539
01:42:59,190 --> 01:43:02,110
It's the unbreakable bond that ties us all
together.

1540
01:43:02,950 --> 01:43:04,390
It's what makes us a family.

1541
01:43:06,150 --> 01:43:10,170
I wonder, do you have it yet, young as you
are?

1542
01:43:15,640 --> 01:43:17,040
I think so.

1543
01:43:21,540 --> 01:43:25,120
I wish to pass on the will of fire to the
children of the future.

1544
01:43:25,820 --> 01:43:27,300
To children like Naruto.

1545
01:43:52,700 --> 01:43:55,860
I'm in the mountain, never coming down.

1546
01:43:56,140 --> 01:43:59,500
Breaking through the contents,
never falling down.

1547
01:44:03,060 --> 01:44:06,060
My head's still shaking, like I was
trying.

1548
01:44:06,280 --> 01:44:09,480
Sneaking at the classroom, by the back
door.

1549
01:44:09,680 --> 01:44:12,940
A morrow let me try some, but I didn't
care.

1550
01:44:13,140 --> 01:44:16,360
Waiting is wasted for people like me.

1551
01:44:16,361 --> 01:44:19,640
Don't try to look so wise.

1552
01:44:20,280 --> 01:44:22,960
Don't cry cause you're so right.

1553
01:44:23,380 --> 01:44:26,620
Don't try to expect the worst.

1554
01:44:26,800 --> 01:44:29,920
Cause you were in this area in the end.

1555
01:44:39,180 --> 01:44:42,580
Don't try to look so wise.

1556
01:44:42,920 --> 01:44:45,980
Don't cry cause you're so right.

1557
01:44:46,360 --> 01:44:49,600
Don't try to expect the worst.

1558
01:44:49,720 --> 01:44:52,960
Cause you were hating yourself in the end.

1559
01:44:53,520 --> 01:44:56,360
Don't try to look so wise.

1560
01:44:56,720 --> 01:44:59,700
Don't cry cause you're so right.

